d"],"about":"Nandha Dental College and Hospital was established in 2021 under the Sri Nandha Educational Trust, founded in 1992 by Chairman Thiru. V. Shanmugan, B.Com. Located on the Erode–Perundurai Main Road at Pitchandampalayam, Erode, the college is recognized by the Dental Council of India, approved by the Ministry of Health & Family Welfare, Government of India, and affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University, Chennai.\\n\\nThe college offers the undergraduate Bachelor of Dental Surgery (BDS) programme, a 5-year course comprising 4 years of academics and a compulsory 1-year internship. Guided by the motto \\"Learn, Serve, Succeed,\\" the institution combines dental education with clinical training aimed at meeting the oral healthcare needs of Erode district and surrounding areas. The college runs a functioning dental hospital across departments including Oral Surgery, Prosthodontics, Periodontics, Pedodontics, Public Health Dentistry, Conservative Dentistry, and Orthodontics, and reported a monthly patient footfall of over 2,500 across these departments as of July 2026.","highlights":["DCI Recognized Dental Institution","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","Approved by Ministry of Health & Family Welfare, Govt. of India","Wi-Fi Enabled LCD-Projector Classrooms","CCTV-Enabled Campus Security","Regular Dental Camps & School Health Programmes","Part of Sri Nandha Educational Trust (est. 1992)","5-Year BDS Programme with Compulsory Internship"],"departments":[{"name":"BDS (Bachelor of Dental Surgery)","level":"UG"},{"name":"Department of Prosthodontics","level":"UG"},{"name":"Department of Oral Medicine and Radiology","level":"UG"},{"name":"Department of Oral Surgery","level":"UG"},{"name":"Department of Periodontics and Implantology","level":"UG"},{"name":"Department of Orthodontics","level":"UG"},{"name":"Department of Conservative Dentistry and Endodontics","level":"UG"},{"name":"Department of Pedodontics","level":"UG"},{"name":"Department of Public Health Dentistry","level":"UG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Wi-Fi Enabled LCD Projector Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Library & Journals"},{"icon":"ti-flask","name":"Basic Medical Sciences Labs"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Separate Hostels"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport Facility"},{"icon":"ti-heartbeat","name":"Dental Hospital"},{"icon":"ti-shield","name":"CCTV-Enabled Security"},{"icon":"ti-heart","name":"Ambulance Service"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports Facilities"},{"icon":"ti-food","name":"Canteen"},{"icon":"ti-credit-card","name":"Bank and ATM"},{"icon":"ti-medall","name":"Tutorial Rooms"}],"placementRate":70,"avgPackage":"₹3.2 LPA","highestPackage":"₹6.5 LPA","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Qualify NEET UG","desc":"Candidates must have 10+2 with Physics, Chemistry, Biology and a minimum 50% aggregate, and qualify NEET UG."},{"title":"Register for Tamil Nadu State Counselling","desc":"Apply through the Directorate of Medical Education (DME), Tamil Nadu at tnmedicalselection.net for 100% State Quota counselling."},{"title":"Choose NDCH, Erode as Preferred College","desc":"Select Nandha Dental College and Hospital during the counselling choice-filling process."},{"title":"Document Verification & Fee Payment","desc":"Complete document verification and fee payment at the allotted counselling centre."},{"title":"Confirm Admission at NDCH","desc":"Report to the college campus with original documents for final enrollment."}],"scholarships":["Management Merit Scholarship","SC/ST Scholarship (Govt. of Tamil Nadu)","First Graduate Scholarship","BC/MBC Scholarship"],"events":["Festaura — Annual Sports & Cultural Fest","World Prosthodontist Day","World Anatomy Day","National Cons-Endo Day","Innovation Day","Anti-Ragging Awareness Week","Pongal Celebrations","Oral Health Camps & School Programmes"],"distanceInfo":{"airport":"45 km","railway":"12 km","bustand":"8 km","metro":"N/A","hospital":"On 