ealthcare Professions)","Govt. of India","SRM IST Deemed-to-be-University (UGC)","BOT (Bachelor of Occupational Therapy)","MOT — Neurosciences","MOT — Paediatrics & Neonatology","MOT — Musculoskeletal Sciences (Orthopaedics)","MOT — Hand Therapy","MOT — Rehabilitation Sciences"],"canonicalUrl":null,"robots":"index, follow","h1":"SRM College of Occupational Therapy, Tiruchirappalli","openGraph":{"title":"SRM College of Occupational Therapy - CollegeShine","description":"SRM College of Occupational Therapy, Tiruchirappalli is a private (deemed-to-be university) occupational therapy college in Tiruchirappalli established in.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/srm-school-of-law.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"SRM College of Occupational Therapy - CollegeShine","description":"SRM College of Occupational Therapy, Tiruchirappalli is a private (deemed-to-be university) occupational therapy college in Tiruchirappalli established in.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/srm-school-of-law.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"SRM College of Occupational Therapy, Tiruchirappalli","shortName":"SRM College of Occupational Therapy","tagline":"Rebuilding Confidence, Restoring Daily Living","category":"occupational-therapy","type":"Deemed-to-be-University College (Occupational Therapy)","ownership":"Private (Deemed-to-be University)","established":2018,"location":"Tiruchirappalli","district":"Tiruchirappalli","address":"SRM Institute of Science and Technology, Tiruchirappalli Campus, SRM Nagar, Trichy–Chennai Highway, Near Samayapuram, Tiruchirappalli 621105, Tamil Nadu","mapLink":"https://maps.google.com/?q=SRM+Institute+of+Science+and+Technology+Tiruchirappalli","mapQuery":"SRM+Institute+of+Science+and+Technology+Tiruchirappalli","website":"https://www.srmtrichy.edu.in/college-of-occupational-therapy","phone":"1800 202 4565","email":"mailto:helpdesk@ist.srmtrichy.edu.in","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/srm-school-of-law.webp","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/__68412Y9Vs?si=naa_CzT3f8pHkV_w","affiliation":"SRM Institute of Science and Technology (Deemed to be University); programmes aligned to AIOTA, WFOT and NCAHP (Govt. of India) guidelines","accreditation":["Aligned to AIOTA (All India Occupational Therapists'' Association) Guidelines","Aligned to WFOT (World Federation of Occupational Therapists) Standards","Regulated under NCAHP (National Commission for Allied and Healthcare Professions), Govt. of India","SRM IST Deemed-to-be-University (UGC)"],"about":"The College of Occupational Therapy at SRM Institute of Science and Technology, Tiruchirappalli Campus is a client-centered healthcare education institution dedicated to preparing competent occupational therapy professionals who can address the evolving healthcare needs of society. The college delivers high-quality education, research, and clinical training aligned with the guidelines of the All India Occupational Therapists'' Association (AIOTA), the World Federation of Occupational Therapists (WFOT), and the regulatory framework of the National Commission for Allied and Healthcare Professions (NCAHP), Government of India.\\n\\nThe curriculum combines strong theoretical foundations with extensive clinical exposure in hospitals, rehabilitation centers, schools, and community settings, supported by experienced faculty and modern learning facilities. The college is attached to a 1,750-bedded multi-speciality hospital and maintains MOUs with organizations such as Spastic Society Trichy, Sunrise Foundation Deaddiction Centre, Poornodhaya Special School, and the Spinal Injured Persons Association, Tamil Nadu, along with active community outreach programmes in villages around Irungalur and Samayapuram, Tiruchirappalli district.","highlights":["Attached to 1,750-Bedded Multi-Speciality Hospital","Separate Clinical Areas for Different Specialities","Simulation Labs for Enhanced Learning","Aligned to AIOTA, WFOT & NCAHP Standards","MOUs with Spastic Society, Sunrise Foundation, Poornodhaya Special School & More","Community Outreach in Irungalur & Samayapuram Villages","Placement Support in India, USA, UK, Canada, Australia, Singapore & Middle East","Computerized Central Library with 15,000+ Books"],"departments":[{"name":"BOT (Bachelor of Occupational Therapy)","level":"UG"},{"name":"MOT — Neurosciences","level":"PG"},{"name":"MOT — Paediatrics & Neonatology","level":"PG"},{"name":"MOT — Musculoskeletal Sciences (Orthopaedics)","level":"PG"},{"name":"MOT — Hand Therapy","level":"PG"},{"name":"MOT — Rehabilitation Sciences","level":"PG"},{"name":"MOT — Oncological Sciences","level":"PG"},{"name":"MOT — Geriatrics","level":"PG"},{"name":"MOT — Cardiovascular and Pulmonary Sciences","level":"PG"},{"name":"MOT — Mental Health","level":"PG"},{"name":"Ph.D — Occupational Therapy","level":"PhD"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Wide Wi-Fi"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Computerized Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-flask","name":"Simulation Labs"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Hostels"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport Facility"},{"icon":"ti-heartbeat","name":"1,750-Bed Multi-Speciality Hospital"},{"icon":"ti-crown","name":"Placement & Career Guidance Cell"},{"icon":"ti-cpu","name":"Smart Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports Facilities"},{"icon":"ti-heart","name":"Clinical Training Areas"},{"icon":"ti-medall","name":"Research & Innovation Support"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Seminar & Conference Halls"}],"placementRate":80,"avgPackage":"₹3.5 LPA","highestPackage":"₹7 LPA","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Meet Eligibility Criteria","desc":"Candidates must have completed 10+2 with Physics, Chemistry, Biology (for BOT) or hold a relevant BOT degree (for MOT)."},{"title":"Apply Online","desc":"Complete the SRM Trichy application form through the official admissions portal."},{"title":"Counselling / Interaction","desc":"Shortlisted candidates may be called for a counselling session or interaction with the admissions team."},{"title":"Document Verification & Fee Payment","desc":"Submit original documents and pay the prescribed fees to confirm the seat."},{"title":"Orientation & Enrollment","desc":"Report to the college campus for orientation and final enrollment into the programme."}],"scholarships":["SRM Merit Scholarship","SRM Sports Scholarship","Need-Based Financial Assistance"],"events":["World Occupational Therapy Day","Workshops (Departmental)","Guest Lectures","Conferences","Seminars","Community Outreach Camps — Irungalur & Samayapuram"],"distanceInfo":{"airport":"22 km","railway":"15 km","bustand":"12 km","metro":"N/A","hospital":"On Campus"},"hostelFeatures":["Separate Boys & Girls Hostels","Wi-Fi Facility","Mess Facility","24x7 Security","Recreation Areas"],"technicalClubs":["Occupational Therapy Research Club","Clinical Skill Development Club","Innovation & Assistive Devices Cell"],"culturalClubs":["Dance Club","Music Club","Fine Arts Club","Photography Club"],"communityService":["NSS","NCC","Disability Surveys — Irungalur & Samayapuram Villages","Health Education Camps","Occupational Therapy Community Interventions"]}'),
