/08/Government_Cuddalore_Medical_College_collegeshine.webp","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/WTeNnadsGUA?si=gDvhVvjq4-wyo_GG&amp;start=7","affiliation":"Affiliated to Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University; functioning under the Directorate of Medical Education (DME), Government of Tamil Nadu since 2021 (formerly Rajah Muthiah Medical College, Annamalai University)","accreditation":["Government Institution under DME, Tamil Nadu","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","One of Three Premier PMR Centres in Tamil Nadu (with GRIM Chennai & CMC Vellore)"],"about":"The Bachelor of Occupational Therapy (BOT) programme at Government Medical College and Hospital, Chidambaram (erstwhile Rajah Muthiah Medical College) is run within the Department of Physical Medicine & Rehabilitation (PMR), one of only three premier PMR centres in Tamil Nadu alongside the Government Institute of Rehabilitation Medicine, Chennai, and CMC Vellore. The BOT course began in 1994 and offers 20 seats, with a 4-year academic programme followed by a 6-month internship.\\n\\nThe PMR division grew from a two-member unit in a 500 sq ft space to a full-fledged division with separate sections for Physiotherapy, Occupational Therapy, an Artificial Limb Centre, Play Therapy, and a Community Rehabilitation Programme, spread over 22,000 sq ft. The college itself was established in 1985, named after philanthropist Rajah Muthiah Chettiar, and was taken over by the Government of Tamil Nadu in February 2021 under G.O. 45, functioning under the Directorate of Medical Education (DME) since then. The attached hospital has 1,250 beds and treats around 2,800–3,000 outpatients daily.","highlights":["BOT Course Running Since 1994 — 20 Seats","One of Three Premier PMR Centres in Tamil Nadu","Attached to 1,250-Bed Government Hospital","Separate Occupational Therapy, Physiotherapy, Artificial Limb Centre, Play Therapy & Community Rehab Sections","22,000 Sq Ft Dedicated PMR Division Facility","Government Institution — Affordable Fee Structure","Interdisciplinary Curriculum with English, Psychology, Sociology, Yoga & More","Alumni Placed Across India and Abroad"],"departments":[{"name":"BOT (Bachelor of Occupational Therapy)","level":"UG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Network with Internet Section"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Medical Library (22,429 Books)"},{"icon":"ti-flask","name":"Occupational Therapy & Rehabilitation Labs"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Separate Hostels (Boys & Girls)"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport Block"},{"icon":"ti-heartbeat","name":"1,250-Bed Multi-Speciality Hospital"},{"icon":"ti-crown","name":"Artificial Limb Centre"},{"icon":"ti-heart","name":"Play Therapy Section"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports Activities"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Air-Conditioned Lecture Halls"},{"icon":"ti-cpu","name":"Community Rehabilitation Programme"},{"icon":"ti-medall","name":"Doctor''s Cafeteria"}],"placementRate":75,"avgPackage":"₹2.8 LPA","highestPackage":"₹5.5 LPA","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Meet Eligibility Criteria","desc":"Candidates must have completed 10+2 with Physics, Chemistry, Biology as per Tamil Nadu allied health sciences admission norms."},{"title":"Apply via Tamil Nadu Paramedical / Allied Health Counselling","desc":"Register through the applicable state government counselling process for allied health science seats."},{"title":"Choice Filling","desc":"Select Government Medical College and Hospital, Chidambaram BOT as a preference during counselling."},{"title":"Document Verification & Seat Allotment","desc":"Complete document verification; seats are allotted based on merit and category reservation."},{"title":"Reporting & Enrollment","desc":"Report to the college with original documents to confirm admission into the BOT programme."}],"scholarships":["Tamil Nadu Government Scholarship Schemes (as applicable to Allied Health Sciences students)"],"events":["Academy of Medical Sciences Monthly Meetings","Annual Medical Speaker Meets","Cultural Activities","Sports Activities","Academic Activities (Orientation, Workshops, Seminars)"],"distanceInfo":{"airport":"65 km","railway":"3 km","bustand":"2 km","metro":"N/A","hospital":"On Campus"},"hostelFeatures":["Separate Boys & Girls Hostels","Mess Facility"],"technicalClubs":[],"culturalClubs":[],"communityService":["Community Rehabilitation Programme","Health Camps","Disability Screening & Rehabilitation Outreach"]}'),
('government-thiruvannamalai-medical-college-and-hospital','government-thiruvannamalai-medical-college-and-hospital','Government Thiruvannamalai Medical College & Hospital','GTMCH Thiruvannamalai','mbbs','Government Medical College','Government (Government of Tamil Nadu, under DME)','2013','Thiruvannamalai','Tiruvannamalai','Outer Ring Road, Vengikkal New Town, Thirinjapuram Union, Thiruvannamalai District, Tamil Nadu','https://maps.google.com/?q=Government+Thiruvannamalai+Medical+College+and+Hospital','http://www.gtvmmc.ac.in/gtvmmc/index.jsp','04175-233315, 04175-238455','mailto:deantvmmedicalcollege@gmail.com','https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Government-Thiruvannamalai-Medical-College-collegeshine-scaled.webp','Government Thiruvannamalai Medical College & - CollegeShine','Government Thiruvannamalai Medical College & Hospital is a government (government of tamil nadu, under dme) mbbs college in Thiruvannamalai established in.',NULL, '{"id":"government-thiruvannamalai-medical-college-and-hospital","seo":{"metaTitle":"Government Thiruvannamalai Medical College & - CollegeShine","metaDescription":"Government Thiruvannamalai Medical College & Hospital is a government (government of tamil nadu, under dme) mbbs college in Thiruvannamalai established in.","metaKeywords":["Government Thiruvannamalai Medical College & Hospital","GTMCH Thiruvannamalai","Government Thiruvannamalai Medical College & Hospital admission 2026","Government Thiruvannamalai Medical College & Hospital fees","Government Thiruvannamalai Medical College & Hospital courses","MBBS colleges in Tiruvannamalai","Thiruvannamalai","Tiruvannamalai","MBBS","Government (Government of Tamil Nadu","under DME)","Government Medical College","Government Institution under DME","Tamil Nadu","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","Chennai","Recognized — Degrees Granted On or After February 2018","MD Paediatrics","MS Obstetrics and Gynaecology"],"canonicalUrl":null,"robots":"index, follow","h1":"Government Thiruvannamalai Medical College & Hospital","openGraph":{"title":"Government Thiruvannamalai Medical College & - CollegeShine","description":"Government Thiruvannamalai Medical College & Hospital is a government (government of tamil nadu, under dme) mbbs college in Thiruvannamalai established in.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Government-Thiruvannamalai-Medical-College-collegeshine-scaled.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Government Thiruvannamalai Medical College & - CollegeShine","description":"Government Thiruvannamalai Medical College & Hospital is a government (government of tamil nadu, under dme) mbbs college in Thiruvannamalai established in.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Government-Thiruvannamalai-Medical-College-collegeshine-scaled.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"Government Thiruvannamalai Medical College & Hospital","shortName":"GTMCH Thiruvannamalai","tagline":"Serving Health, Shaping Doctors","category":"mbbs","type":"Government Medical College","ownership":"Government (Government of Tamil Nadu, under DME)","established":2013,"location":"Thiruvannamalai","district":"Tiruvannamalai","address":"Outer Ring Road, Vengikkal New Town, Thirinjapuram Union, Thiruvannamalai District, Tamil Nadu","mapLink":"https://maps.google.com/?q=Government+Thiruvannamalai+Medical+College+and+Hospital","mapQuery":"Government+Thiruvannamalai+Medical+College+and+Hospital","website":"http://www.gtvmmc.ac.in/gtvmmc/index.jsp","phone":"04175-233315, 04175-238455","email":"mailto:deantvmmedicalcollege@gmail.com","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Government-Thiruvannamalai-Medical-College-collegeshine-scaled.webp","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/SdhzNZaycWk?si=f5P2LholiSwFqg-k&amp;start=66","affiliation":"Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University, Chennai; functioning under the Directorate of Medical Education (DME), Government of Tamil Nadu","accreditation":["Government Institution under DME, Tamil Nadu","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University, Chennai","Recognized — Degrees Granted On or After February 2018"],"about":"Government Thiruvannamalai Medical College and Hospital (GTMCH) is a government medical college operated by the Government of Tamil Nadu, situated on the Thiruvannamalai Outer Ring Road in Vengikkal New Town, Thirinjapuram Union, Thiruvannamalai district. The college emerged from the transfer of the 440-bed Tiruvannamalai Government District Headquarters Hospital — which began as a Taluk hospital in 1950 — to the Department of Medical Education on 1 April 2012. It was relaunched as a teaching hospital offering 100 undergraduate MBBS seats, with the first batch commencing studies in the 2013–2014 academic year.\\n\\nThe college is affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University, Chennai and is recognized for degrees granted on or after February 2018. Spread over 35.44 acres, the college offers MBBS along with postgraduate programmes in MD Paediatrics and MS Obstetrics & Gynaecology. The hospital''s clinical departments include Medicine and Surgery (120 beds across 4 units), Obstetrics & Gynaecology, Paediatrics and Orthopaedics (60 beds across 2 units), Chest Medicine, Ophthalmology and ENT (20 beds), and Dermatology and Psychiatry (20 beds), along with attached Primary Health Centres for rural and urban health training.","highlights":["100 MBBS Seats — Government Medical College","35.44-Acre Campus","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","MD Paediatrics & MS Obstetrics and Gynaecology Postgraduate Courses","Separate Boys & Girls Hostels — 250 Rooms","Central Library with 7,014 Books & 100 Journals","Attached Rural & Urban Health Training Centres","Emerged from 440-Bed District Headquarters Hospital (Est. 1950)"],"departments":[{"name":"MBBS","level":"UG"},{"name":"MD Paediatrics","level":"PG"},{"name":"MS Obstetrics and Gynaecology","level":"PG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Internet & MEDLAR Facility (25 Nodes)"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-flask","name":"Clinical & Non-Clinical Departments"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Separate Hostels (250 Rooms)"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport Facility"},{"icon":"ti-heartbeat","name":"440-Bed Multi-Department Hospital"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports — Cricket, Volleyball, Badminton, Gymnasium"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Examination Hall (250 sqm)"},{"icon":"ti-cpu","name":"5 Lecture Theatres"},{"icon":"ti-medall","name":"Rural & Urban Health Training Centres"}],"placementRate":"data not available","avgPackage":"data not available","highestPackage":"data not available","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Qualify NEET UG","desc":"Candidates must qualify NEET UG with the required aggregate for admission to MBBS."},{"title":"Register for Tamil Nadu / All India Counselling","desc":"Apply through Tamil Nadu state medical counselling or the All India Quota (AIQ) counselling process as applicable."},{"title":"Choice Filling","desc":"Select Government Thiruvannamalai Medical College during the choice-filling process."},{"title":"Document Verification & Seat Allotment","desc":"Complete document verification; seats allotted based on NEET rank and category reservation."},{"title":"Reporting & Bond Signing","desc":"Report to the college with original documents; MBBS admission includes a compulsory rural service bond of 5 years (penalty ₹5,00,000 if skipped)."}],"scholarships":[],"events":[],"distanceInfo":{"airport":"85 km (Katpadi) / 180 km (Chennai)","railway":"7.7 km","bustand":"4.8 km","metro":"N/A","hospital":"On Campus"},"hostelFeatures":["Separate Boys & Girls Hostels","250 Rooms","Internet Connection"],"technicalClubs":[],"culturalClubs":[],"communityService":["Rural Health Training Centre — Kattampoondi PHC (17 km)","Urban Health Training Centre — Municipal PHC (7 km)"]}'),
('college-of-occupational-therapy-niepmd','college-of-occupational-therapy-niepmd','College of Occupational Therapy, NIEPMD','NIEPMD — Occupational Therapy','occupational-therapy','National Institute (Central Government, Ministry of Social Justice & Empowerment)','Government (Government of India)','2005','Muttukadu, Chennai','Chengalpattu','East Coast Road, Muttukadu, Chennai, Tamil Nadu (about 30 km from Chennai Central Railway Station, Mofussil Bus Terminus and Airport)','https://maps.google.com/?q=NIEPMD+Muttukadu+Chennai','https://niepmd.nic.in/bot/','9444314716','mailto:niepmd@nic.in','https://cdnbbsr.s3waas.gov.in/s33837a451cd0abc5ce4069304c5442c87/uploads/2024/09/2024091260708867.png','College of Occupational Therapy, NIEPMD - CollegeShine','College of Occupational Therapy, NIEPMD is a government (government of india) occupational therapy college in Muttukadu, Chennai established in 2005.',NULL, '{"id":"college-of-occupational-therapy-niepmd","seo":{"metaTitle":"College of Occupational Therapy, NIEPMD - CollegeShine","metaDescription":"College of Occupational Therapy, NIEPMD is a government (government of india) occupational therapy college in Muttukadu, Chennai established in 2005.","metaKeywords":["College of Occupational Therapy","NIEPMD","NIEPMD — Occupational Therapy","College of Occupational Therapy","NIEPMD admission 2026","College of Occupational Therapy","NIEPMD fees","College of Occupational Therapy","NIEPMD courses","Occupational Therapy colleges in Chengalpattu","Muttukadu","Chennai","Chengalpattu","Occupational Therapy","Government (Government of India)","National Institute (Central Government","Ministry of Social Justice & Empowerment)","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","Chennai","Under Department of Empowerment of Persons with Disabilities (Divyangjan)","Govt. of India","NAAC Accredited (Institute-Level)","B.O.T (Bachelor of Occupational Therapy)"],"canonicalUrl":null,"robots":"index, follow","h1":"College of Occupational Therapy, NIEPMD","openGraph":{"title":"College of Occupational Therapy, NIEPMD - CollegeShine","description":"College of Occupational Therapy, NIEPMD is a government (government of india) occupational therapy college in Muttukadu, Chennai established in 2005.","image":"https://cdnbbsr.s3waas.gov.in/s33837a451cd0abc5ce4069304c5442c87/uploads/2024/09/2024091260708867.png","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"College of Occupational Therapy, NIEPMD - CollegeShine","description":"College of Occupational Therapy, NIEPMD is a government (government of india) occupational therapy college in Muttukadu, Chennai established in 2005.","image":"https://cdnbbsr.s3waas.gov.in/s33837a451cd0abc5ce4069304c5442c87/uploads/2024/09/2024091260708867.png"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"College of Occupational Therapy, NIEPMD","shortName":"NIEPMD — Occupational Therapy","tagline":"Empowering Persons with Multiple Disabilities","category":"occupational-therapy","type":"National Institute (Central Government, Ministry of Social Justice & Empowerment)","ownership":"Government (Government of India)","established":2005,"location":"Muttukadu, Chennai","district":"Chengalpattu","address":"East Coast Road, Muttukadu, Chennai, Tamil Nadu (about 30 km from Chennai Central Railway Station, Mofussil Bus Terminus and Airport)","mapLink":"https://maps.google.com/?q=NIEPMD+Muttukadu+Chennai","mapQuery":"NIEPMD+Muttukadu+Chennai","website":"https://niepmd.nic.in/bot/","phone":"9444314716","email":"mailto:niepmd@nic.in","image":"https://cdnbbsr.s3waas.gov.in/s33837a451cd0abc5ce4069304c5442c87/uploads/2024/09/2024091260708867.png","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4cqXKPB05fE?si=3V6X9wYDR4S9yFIA&amp;start=66","affiliation":"Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University, Chennai; functions under the Department of Empowerment of Persons with Disabilities (Divyangjan), Ministry of Social Justice & Empowerment, Government of India","accreditation":["Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University, Chennai","Under Department of Empowerment of Persons with Disabilities (Divyangjan), Govt. of India","NAAC Accredited (Institute-Level)"],"about":"The College of Occupational Therapy functions under the National Institute for Empowerment of Persons with Multiple Disabilities (Divyangjan) (NIEPMD), established in 2005 on East Coast Road, Muttukadu, Chennai, under the Department of Empowerment of Persons with Disabilities, Ministry of Social Justice & Empowerment, Government of India. NIEPMD serves as a national resource centre for the empowerment of persons with multiple disabilities, covering conditions enumerated under the RPWD Act (2016) and The National Trust Act (1999), including Autism, Cerebral Palsy, Intellectual Disability, and Multiple Disabilities including deafblindness.\\n\\nThe Bachelor of Occupational Therapy (B.O.T) programme is affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University, Chennai, and runs as a 4-academic-year programme followed by a 6-month compulsory internship, in a non-semester pattern. Admission is through the Common Entrance Test (CET) for the All India Quota and through counselling conducted by the Directorate of Medical Education, Tamil Nadu for the State Quota, as approved by the Nodal Ministry. The programme trains occupational therapists across Paediatrics, Psychiatry, Geriatrics, Orthopaedics, Neurology, and Hand Rehabilitation, covering evaluation, therapeutic intervention, splinting and assistive device fabrication, activities-of-daily-living training, and environmental modification.","highlights":["Central Government National Institute — Ministry of Social Justice & Empowerment","B.O.T Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","4-Year Programme + 6-Month Compulsory Internship","Admission via CET (All India Quota) & DME Tamil Nadu Counselling (State Quota)","Training Across Paediatrics, Psychiatry, Geriatrics, Orthopaedics, Neurology & Hand Rehabilitation","National Resource Centre for Persons with Multiple Disabilities","NAAC Accredited Institute","On East Coast Road, ~30 km from Chennai Central & Airport"],"departments":[{"name":"B.O.T (Bachelor of Occupational Therapy)","level":"UG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Network"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"NIEPMD Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-flask","name":"Clinical & Therapy Labs"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Hostel Facility"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport Facility"},{"icon":"ti-heartbeat","name":"Department of Medical Science"},{"icon":"ti-crown","name":"Department of Therapeutics"},{"icon":"ti-heart","name":"Department of Adult Independent Living"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports & Recreation"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Seminar Halls"},{"icon":"ti-cpu","name":"Digital Learning Facilities"},{"icon":"ti-medall","name":"Research & Development Wing"}],"placementRate":85,"avgPackage":"₹3.5 LPA","highestPackage":"₹6 LPA","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Meet Eligibility Criteria","desc":"Candidates from all categories must have passed Higher Secondary (H.Sc) or equivalent with Physics, Chemistry, and Biology/Botany & Zoology."},{"title":"All India Quota — Common Entrance Test (CET)","desc":"Candidates applying under the All India Quota must appear for and qualify the CET conducted by NIEPMD."},{"title":"State Quota — DME Tamil Nadu Counselling","desc":"Candidates applying under the Tamil Nadu State Quota go through counselling conducted by the Directorate of Medical Education (DME), Tamil Nadu."},{"title":"Document Verification & Seat Allotment","desc":"Complete document verification; seats are allotted based on merit, with reservation for SC/ST/OBC/PwD and others as per Government norms."},{"title":"Reporting & Enrollment","desc":"Report to NIEPMD with original documents for final enrollment into the B.O.T programme."}],"scholarships":["Reservation & Fee Concession for SC/ST/OBC/PwD Candidates (as per Government of India norms)"],"events":["International Day of Yoga","World Autism Awareness Day","Helen Keller Birth Anniversary Celebration","CRE Webinars","Conferences","Purple Fair (Disability Awareness & Inclusion Event)"],"distanceInfo":{"airport":"30 km","railway":"30 km","bustand":"30 km","metro":"N/A","hospital":"On Campus (Dept. of Medical Science)"},"hostelFeatures":["Separate Boys & Girls Hostels","Mess Facility","Wi-Fi Facility","24x7 Security"],"technicalClubs":["Occupational Therapy Research Club","Assistive Device Innovation Cell","Clinical Skill Development Club"],"culturalClubs":["Dance Club","Music Club","Fine Arts Club"],"communityService":["Flagship Programme for SC/ST Project","Flagship Programme — North East Project","Corporate Social Responsibility (CSR) Initiatives","Community Awareness & Outreach for Persons with Disabilities"]}'),
