cal University; approved by the Government of Tamil Nadu vide G.O. (MS) No.344 Dt. 10.08.2018","accreditation":["Approved by Government of Tamil Nadu (G.O. (MS) No.344 Dt. 10.08.2018)","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","Ragging-Free Campus"],"about":"Krishna College of Paramedical and Allied Health Science was started in the academic year 2018-2019 by the Ramakrishnan Education and Charities Trust. It is approved by the Government of Tamil Nadu vide G.O. (MS) No.344 Dt. 10.08.2018 and affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University. Located at Kottaimedu, Samayapuram, near Trichy, the college offers Nursing, Paramedical, and Allied Health Science programmes, including the Bachelor of Occupational Therapy (BOT).\\n\\nThe BOT programme is a 5-year undergraduate course with an intake of 60 seats, designed to train students in occupational therapy across rehabilitation, multi-specialty hospital, and community health settings. Clinical training is supported through tie-ups with Sri Venkateswara Hospitals (the parent 150-bed multi-specialty hospital, 11 km from the college), Lalgudi Government Hospital (12 km away), and the 1,500-bed Mahatma Gandhi Memorial Government Hospital, Trichy. The campus features cross-ventilated classrooms with LCD projectors, a well-equipped library, a 34-computer lab, hostel facilities with 24x7 security, and a dedicated transport bus for students and staff.","highlights":["BOT — 5-Year Programme, 60 Seats","Approved by Govt. of Tamil Nadu (2018)","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","Clinical Tie-Ups with Sri Venkateswara Hospitals, Lalgudi Govt. Hospital & MGM Govt. Hospital Trichy","Cross-Ventilated LCD Classrooms — 60-Student Capacity Each","34-Computer Lab with Internet Access","Separate Hostel with 24x7 Security & Surveillance","Dedicated College Transport Bus","Ragging-Free Campus","Scholarships Available for Deserving Candidates"],"departments":[{"name":"BOT (Bachelor of Occupational Therapy)","level":"UG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Computer Lab with Internet (34 Computers)"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Library (1,065 Books, 15 Journals)"},{"icon":"ti-flask","name":"Anatomy & Clinical Skills Laboratories"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Separate Boys & Girls Hostel"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"College Transport Bus (60-Seater)"},{"icon":"ti-heartbeat","name":"Clinical Training Hospitals"},{"icon":"ti-crown","name":"Auditorium"},{"icon":"ti-heart","name":"Yoga Hall"},{"icon":"ti-shield","name":"24x7 Security & CCTV Surveillance"},{"icon":"ti-cpu","name":"LCD Projector Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-medall","name":"Nutrition Laboratory"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Conference & Workshop Facilities"}],"placementRate":70,"avgPackage":"₹2.5 LPA","highestPackage":"₹5 LPA","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Meet Eligibility Criteria","desc":"Candidates must have passed +2 with Physics, Chemistry, Maths and Biology/Botany & Zoology, and be at least 17 years old at the time of admission."},{"title":"Application Submission","desc":"Download and submit the college application form (available on the official website) for the relevant academic year."},{"title":"Document Verification","desc":"Submit original academic and identity documents for verification at the college."},{"title":"Merit-Based Admission","desc":"Seats are allotted based on merit and eligibility as per college and university norms."},{"title":"Fee Payment & Enrollment","desc":"Complete fee payment and reporting formalities to confirm admission into the BOT programme."}],"scholarships":["Merit-Based Scholarships for Deserving Candidates (as mentioned on official site, specific schemes not detailed)"],"events":["Freshers'' Day","Annual College Day","Sports Meet","World Occupational Therapy Day","Clinical Skills Workshop"],"distanceInfo":{"airport":"20 km","railway":"15 km","bustand":"12 km","metro":"N/A","hospital":"11 km (Sri Venkateswara Hospitals — Parent Hospital)"},"hostelFeatures":["Separate Boys & Girls Hostel","24x7 Security Guards","CCTV Surveillance","Medical Help Available","24-Hour Water Supply"],"technicalClubs":["Clinical Skill Development Club","Occupational Therapy Research Club"],"culturalClubs":["Dance Club","Music Club","Fine Arts Club"],"communityService":["Free Health Camps","Community Rehabilitation Outreach","Blood Donation Camps"]}'),
