dindigul@gmail.com","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/government-medical-college-dindigul.webp","videoUrl":"","affiliation":"Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University; functions under the Directorate of Medical Education (DME), Government of Tamil Nadu","accreditation":["Government Institution under DME, Tamil Nadu","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","Recognized by National Medical Commission (NMC)","Empanelled with Tamil Nadu Medical Services Corporation (TNMSC)"],"about":"Government Medical College and Hospital, Dindigul, functions under the Directorate of Medical Education, Chennai, Tamil Nadu, since 1 March 2021. Alongside its MBBS programme (5 batches of 150 students each), the college runs an Allied Health Sciences wing offering the Bachelor of Science in Medical Laboratory Technology (B.Sc. MLT) and a range of certificate-level paramedical courses.\\n\\nThe B.Sc. MLT programme is a 3-year, 6-semester undergraduate course combining theoretical knowledge with hands-on laboratory training in Biochemistry, Microbiology, Hematology, Clinical Pathology, Immunology & Serology, Blood Banking, and Histopathology & Cytology. Graduates are trained in sample collection, use of advanced laboratory equipment, and diagnostic testing, preparing them for roles as medical laboratory technicians, laboratory supervisors, blood bank technologists, and quality control analysts. The college additionally offers certificate courses in Emergency Care Technician, Dialysis Technician, Anaesthesia Technician, Theatre Technician, Orthopedic Technician, and Multipurpose Health Worker (MPHW), reflecting its focus on building a skilled allied healthcare workforce for the region.","highlights":["B.Sc. MLT — 3-Year, 6-Semester Programme","6 Allied Healthcare Certificate Courses (Emergency Care, Dialysis, Anaesthesia, Theatre, Ortho Technician, MPHW)","Functions Under Directorate of Medical Education, Tamil Nadu (Since 2021)","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","Attached Government Hospital with Multiple Clinical Departments","Hands-On Training in Modern Laboratory Equipment","Central Library & Separate Hostel Facilities","Government Institution — Affordable Fee Structure"],"departments":[{"name":"B.Sc. MLT (Medical Laboratory Technology)","level":"UG"},{"name":"Certificate — Emergency Care Technician","level":"UG"},{"name":"Certificate — Dialysis Technician","level":"UG"},{"name":"Certificate — Anaesthesia Technician","level":"UG"},{"name":"Certificate — Theatre Technician","level":"UG"},{"name":"Certificate — Orthopedic Technician","level":"UG"},{"name":"Certificate — Multipurpose Health Worker (MPHW)","level":"UG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Network"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Medical Library"},{"icon":"ti-flask","name":"Medical Laboratory Technology Labs"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Girls & Boys Hostels"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport Facility"},{"icon":"ti-heartbeat","name":"Attached Government Hospital"},{"icon":"ti-shield","name":"Anti-Ragging Committee"},{"icon":"ti-heart","name":"Hospital Infection Control Committee"},{"icon":"ti-cpu","name":"Faculty Block with Modern Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-medall","name":"Biomedical Waste Management"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Medical Education Unit"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports & Recreation"}],"placementRate":75,"avgPackage":"₹2.5 LPA","highestPackage":"₹5 LPA","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Meet Eligibility Criteria","desc":"Candidates must have completed 10+2 with Physics, Chemistry and Biology, with a minimum of 50% marks; minimum age 17 years."},{"title":"Apply via Tamil Nadu Allied Health Sciences Counselling","desc":"Register through the applicable Tamil Nadu government counselling process for Allied Health Sciences / paramedical seats."},{"title":"Choice Filling","desc":"Select Government Medical College Dindigul — B.Sc. MLT or the relevant certificate course as a preference during counselling."},{"title":"Document Verification & Seat Allotment","desc":"Complete document verification; seats allotted based on merit and category reservation, as seen in published merit/allotment lists."},{"title":"Reporting & Enrollment","desc":"Report to the college with original documents to confirm admission."}],"scholarships":["Tamil Nadu Government Scholarship Schemes (as applicable to Allied Health Sciences students)"],"events":["Dindigul Reads (Reading Initiative)","Marathon","Anti-Ragging Day/Week Celebration","CME Programs"],"distanceInfo":{"airport":"70 km (Madurai)","railway":"3 km (Dindigul Junction)","bustand":"4 km","metro":"N/A","hospital":"On Campus"},"hostelFeatures":["Separate Boys & Girls Hostels","Nasha Mukt (Drug-Free) Hostel Initiative"],"technicalClubs":["Medical Laboratory Technology Skill Club","Clinical Research Club"],"culturalClubs":["Dance Club","Music Club","Fine Arts Club"],"communityService":["Dindigul Reads Community Reading Programme","Marathon & Health Awareness Events","Anti-Ragging Awareness Campaigns"]}'),
