 620017","mapLink":"https://maps.google.com/?q=Kaveri+Medical+Centre+and+Hospital+Tennur+Trichy","mapQuery":"Kaveri+Medical+Centre+and+Hospital+Tennur+Trichy","website":"https://www.kauveryhospital.com/paramedical-courses/","phone":"0431-4003500","email":"mailto:ramassamy@hotmail.com","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Kaveri-Medical-Centre-Hospital-Tiruchirappalli-Allied-Health-Sciences-collegeshine.webp","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7YQuzw0Mk9U?si=Zin6gG6wynhwJyDr","affiliation":"B.Sc. Allied Health Sciences programmes affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","accreditation":["Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","Part of Kauvery Hospital Group (Sri Kauvery Medical Care India Ltd)","Training Adjacent to Multi-Speciality Kauvery Hospital"],"about":"Kaveri Medical Centre & Hospital, Tennur, part of the Kauvery Hospital Group, offers Bachelor of Science (B.Sc.) programmes in Allied Health Sciences in affiliation with The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University. The college trains students across four specializations: Cardiac Technology, Dialysis Technology, Operation Theatre & Anaesthesia Technology, and Physician Assistant — each a 4-year programme requiring +2 in Pure Science or Maths with Biology.\\n\\nTraining takes place adjacent to the multi-speciality Kauvery Hospital, giving students hands-on clinical exposure across departments under experienced faculty and doctors. The college highlights a track record of 100% student results, with students having participated in and won awards at national-level conferences. Kauvery Hospital also runs seminars and webinars conducted by expert doctors and faculty as part of the learning experience, alongside a separate free, job-oriented one-year paramedical diploma initiative run in partnership with the Corporation of Chennai and Rotary Club of Madras East for underprivileged students.","highlights":["4 B.Sc. Allied Health Science Programmes — Cardiac Tech, Dialysis Tech, OT & Anaesthesia Tech, Physician Assistant","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","Training Adjacent to Multi-Speciality Kauvery Hospital","100% Student Results (Official Claim)","Hands-On Clinical Training Across All Departments","Students Have Won Awards at National-Level Conferences","Regular Seminars & Webinars by Expert Doctors and Faculty","Part of the Kauvery Hospital Group"],"departments":[{"name":"B.Sc. Cardiac Technology","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Dialysis Technology","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Operation Theatre & Anaesthesia Technology","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Physician Assistant","level":"UG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Hospital Network"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Allied Health Library"},{"icon":"ti-flask","name":"Clinical Skill Labs"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Hostel Facility"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Ambulance Services"},{"icon":"ti-heartbeat","name":"Multi-Speciality Hospital (Adjacent)"},{"icon":"ti-crown","name":"Placement & Career Support"},{"icon":"ti-heart","name":"Clinical Training Across Departments"},{"icon":"ti-cpu","name":"Seminar & Webinar Programs"},{"icon":"ti-medall","name":"National Conference Participation"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Experienced Faculty & Doctor-Led Training"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Student Award Recognition"}],"placementRate":100,"avgPackage":"₹2.2 LPA","highestPackage":"₹4 LPA","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Meet Eligibility Criteria","desc":"Candidates must have completed +2 in Pure Science or Maths with Biology."},{"title":"Apply Online or In-Person","desc":"Submit the paramedical course application through the official Kauvery Hospital website or admissions office."},{"title":"Document Submission","desc":"Submit eligibility certificate (for non-TN Higher Secondary candidates), migration certificate (if applicable), and passport-size photographs."},{"title":"Fee Payment","desc":"Complete fee payment via the specified bank account to confirm the application."},{"title":"Reporting & Enrollment","desc":"Report to the college with original documents for final enrollment into the chosen B.Sc. Allied Health Science programme."}],"scholarships":["Free Job-Oriented Paramedical Diploma (Separate 1-Year Initiative for Underprivileged Students, in Partnership with Corporation of Chennai & Rotary Club of Madras East)"],"events":["National-Level Student Conferences","Seminars by Expert Doctors","Webinars","Award Ceremonies for Student Achievers"],"distanceInfo":{"airport":"7 km (Tiruchirappalli International Airport)","railway":"3 km (Trichy Junction)","bustand":"2 km","metro":"N/A","hospital":"On Site (Kauvery Hospital)"},"hostelFeatures":["Hostel Facility Available"],"technicalClubs":["Clinical Skills Development Club","Allied Health Research Club"],"culturalClubs":["Hospital Cultural Events Committee"],"communityService":["Free Paramedical Diploma for Underprivileged Students (Chennai Corporation Partnership)","Health Awareness Camps"]}'),
('the-sankara-nethralaya-academy-chennai','the-sankara-nethralaya-academy-chennai','Medical Research Foundation (The Sankara Nethralaya Academy), Chennai','TSNA Chennai','allied-health-science','Private Healthcare Education Institute (Academic Arm of Sankara Nethralaya / Medical Research Foundation)','Private (Founded by Late Padma Bhushan Dr. S.S. Badrinath — Sankara Nethralaya Group)','2010','St. Thomas Mount, Chennai','Chennai','Dr. V.G. Appukutty Campus, No.8, GST Road, St. Thomas Mount, Chennai - 600016','https://www.google.com/maps/place/The+Sankara+Nethralaya+Academy/@13.0009773,80.1973177,17z','https://www.thesnacademy.ac.in/','044-4908 6000 (9:00 AM – 4:00 PM)','mailto:snacademy@snmail.org','https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Sankara-Nethralaya-Medical-Research-Foundation-collegeshine.webp','Medical Research Foundation (The Sankara - CollegeShine','Medical Research Foundation (The Sankara Nethralaya Academy), Chennai is a private (founded by late padma bhushan dr. s.s. badrinath — sankara nethralaya.',NULL, '{"id":"the-sankara-nethralaya-academy-chennai","seo":{"metaTitle":"Medical Research Foundation (The Sankara - CollegeShine","metaDescription":"Medical Research Foundation (The Sankara Nethralaya Academy), Chennai is a private (founded by late padma bhushan dr. s.s. badrinath — sankara nethralaya.","metaKeywords":["Medical Research Foundation (The Sankara Nethralaya Academy)","Chennai","TSNA Chennai","Medical Research Foundation (The Sankara Nethralaya Academy)","Chennai admission 2026","Medical Research Foundation (The Sankara Nethralaya Academy)","Chennai fees","Medical Research Foundation (The Sankara Nethralaya Academy)","Chennai courses","Allied Health Science colleges in Chennai","St. Thomas Mount","Chennai","Chennai","Allied Health Science","Private (Founded by Late Padma Bhushan Dr. S.S. Badrinath — Sankara Nethralaya Group)","Private Healthcare Education Institute (Academic Arm of Sankara Nethralaya / Medical Research Foundation)","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","NABL-Accredited Medical Laboratories (On-Campus)","NCAHP-Aligned Curriculum (BMLS & MMLS)","Academic Collaboration with Hindustan Institute of Technology and Science","B.Tech - Aeronautical Engineering","B.Tech - Aerospace Engineering","B.Sc. Aviation Science","B.Sc. Avionics","B.Sc. Aircraft Maintenance"],"canonicalUrl":null,"robots":"index, follow","h1":"Medical Research Foundation (The Sankara Nethralaya Academy), Chennai","openGraph":{"title":"Medical Research Foundation (The Sankara - CollegeShine","description":"Medical Research Foundation (The Sankara Nethralaya Academy), Chennai is a private (founded by late padma bhushan dr. s.s. badrinath — sankara nethralaya.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Sankara-Nethralaya-Medical-Research-Foundation-collegeshine.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Medical Research Foundation (The Sankara - CollegeShine","description":"Medical Research Foundation (The Sankara Nethralaya Academy), Chennai is a private (founded by late padma bhushan dr. s.s. badrinath — sankara nethralaya.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Sankara-Nethralaya-Medical-Research-Foundation-collegeshine.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"Medical Research Foundation (The Sankara Nethralaya Academy), Chennai","shortName":"TSNA Chennai","tagline":"Excellence in Optometry, Healthcare Management and Medical Laboratory Science","category":"allied-health-science","type":"Private Healthcare Education Institute (Academic Arm of Sankara Nethralaya / Medical Research Foundation)","ownership":"Private (Founded by Late Padma Bhushan Dr. S.S. Badrinath — Sankara Nethralaya Group)","established":2010,"location":"St. Thomas Mount, Chennai","district":"Chennai","address":"Dr. V.G. Appukutty Campus, No.8, GST Road, St. Thomas Mount, Chennai - 600016","mapLink":"https://www.google.com/maps/place/The+Sankara+Nethralaya+Academy/@13.0009773,80.1973177,17z","mapQuery":"The+Sankara+Nethralaya+Academy+St+Thomas+Mount+Chennai","website":"https://www.thesnacademy.ac.in/","phone":"044-4908 6000 (9:00 AM – 4:00 PM)","email":"mailto:snacademy@snmail.org","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Sankara-Nethralaya-Medical-Research-Foundation-collegeshine.webp","videoUrl":"","affiliation":"Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University; academic collaboration with Hindustan Institute of Technology and Science","accreditation":["Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","NABL-Accredited Medical Laboratories (On-Campus)","NCAHP-Aligned Curriculum (BMLS & MMLS)","Academic Collaboration with Hindustan Institute of Technology and Science","Approved by NMC (MCI)"],"about":"The Sankara Nethralaya Academy (TSNA), Chennai, is the academic arm of the Medical Research Foundation / Sankara Nethralaya group, founded in 2010 by the late Padma Bhushan Dr. S.S. Badrinath. Operating from the Dr. V.G. Appukutty Campus on GST Road, St. Thomas Mount, TSNA offers globally aligned programmes in affiliation with The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University and in academic collaboration with Hindustan Institute of Technology and Science.\\n\\nTSNA is organised into three schools: the School of Optometry (Master of Optometry plus six clinical fellowship programmes and a certificate course in Occupational Optometry), the School of Management Studies (Master of Hospital Administration), and the School of Medical Laboratory Sciences (Bachelor and Master of Medical Laboratory Science, BMLS/MMLS, both NCAHP-aligned). A separate certificate programme in Hospital Infection Control (CPHIC) is also offered.\\n\\nThe campus features air-conditioned smart classrooms, NABL-accredited medical laboratories (Biochemistry, Microbiology, Haematology, Histopathology), and dedicated optometry clinics including a Contact Lens Clinic, Low Vision Clinic, Binocular Vision & Vision Therapy Clinic, Myopia Clinic, Pediatric Optometry Lab and Sports Clinic. The Medical Laboratory Sciences programme reports 100% placement, 135 undergraduate and 19 postgraduate graduates to date, 20+ student scholarships awarded, and clinical tie-ups with 3+ multi-specialty hospitals, including Kanchi Kamakoti Child Trust Hospital and Sundaram Medical Foundation.","highlights":["Founded by Late Padma Bhushan Dr. S.S. Badrinath (2010)","3 Schools — Optometry, Management Studies, Medical Laboratory Sciences","NCAHP-Aligned BMLS & MMLS Curriculum","NABL-Accredited On-Campus Laboratories","100% Placement Assistance (Official Claim)","Internship Tie-Ups with Kanchi Kamakoti Child Trust Hospital & Sundaram Medical Foundation","Collaboration with Rotary Central TTK-VHS Blood Bank for Transfusion Medicine Training","1000+ Students Enrolled","20+ Student Scholarships Awarded","Academic Collaboration with Hindustan Institute of Technology and Science"],"departments":[{"name":"B.Tech - Aeronautical Engineering","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Tech - Aerospace Engineering","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Aviation Science","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Avionics","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Aircraft Maintenance","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Voc. - Aircraft Maintenance","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.B.A - Aviation Management","level":"PG"},{"name":"BBA - Aviation Services and Air Cargo","level":"UG"},{"name":"M.Tech. Aeronautical Engineering","level":"PG"},{"name":"M.Tech. Aeronautical Engineering - Aircraft Maintenance","level":"PG"},{"name":"M.Tech. Aeronautical Engineering - Avionics","level":"PG"},{"name":"M.Tech. Defence Technology - Aerospace Technology","level":"PG"},{"name":"M.Tech. Defence Technology - Communication Systems & Sensors","level":"PG"},{"name":"M.B.A. - Aviation Management","level":"UG"},{"name":"Advanced Master Program in Aviation Safety Management","level":"UG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Air-Conditioned Smart Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Air-Conditioned Library (Optometry/Healthcare/MLT)"},{"icon":"ti-flask","name":"NABL-Accredited Medical Laboratories"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Hostel Facility"},{"icon":"ti-heartbeat","name":"Contact Lens, Low Vision & Binocular Vision Clinics"},{"icon":"ti-eye","name":"Pediatric Optometry & Myopia Clinic"},{"icon":"ti-crown","name":"Placement Support (100% Claimed)"},{"icon":"ti-heart","name":"Blood Bank Collaboration (Rotary Central TTK-VHS)"},{"icon":"ti-cpu","name":"Digital Monitor-Enabled Interactive Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-medall","name":"National-Level Student Conferences & CMEs"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Alumni Talks & Industry Expert Meets"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Student Scholarship Programme (20+ Awarded)"}],"placementRate":100,"avgPackage":"Not published","highestPackage":"Not published","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Meet Eligibility Criteria","desc":"For BMLS: 10+2 (Science) with at least 50% aggregate in Physics, Chemistry, Biology/Botany & Zoology. For MMLS: Bachelor of Medical Laboratory Science with 50% minimum from a recognized university. For M.Optom and MHA: relevant bachelor''s degree as per programme-specific eligibility."},{"title":"Apply Online","desc":"Download and submit the UG/PG application form available on the official TSNA website, or apply through the Admissions section."},{"title":"Entrance Exam & Interview (for PG programmes)","desc":"MMLS and select postgraduate programmes require candidates to appear for an entrance exam and interview."},{"title":"Document Submission & Fee Payment","desc":"Submit required academic documents and complete fee payment as specified by the admissions office."},{"title":"Reporting & Enrollment","desc":"Report to the Dr. V.G. Appukutty Campus, St. Thomas Mount, with original documents for final enrollment."}],"scholarships":["20+ Student Scholarships Awarded (Medical Laboratory Sciences Programme, Official Figure)"],"events":["Braillive CME Quiz Competition (SRIHER) — Student Prize Winners","Poster Presentation Competitions (Inter-Collegiate CMEs)","Model Making Competition (e.g. VIZENSA obstacle-detection glasses project)","Blood Donation Camps","Yoga & Meditation Sessions","Sports & Cultural Events","Industrial Visits & Alumni Talks/Expert Meets"],"distanceInfo":{"airport":"4 km (Chennai International Airport)","railway":"1 km (St. Thomas Mount Railway Station)","bustand":"2 km","metro":"0.5 km (St. Thomas Mount Metro Station, Chennai Metro Blue Line)","hospital":"Adjacent Network (Sankara Nethralaya Group Hospitals)"},"hostelFeatures":["Hostel Facility Available (Campus Life Section)"],"technicalClubs":["Optometry Clinical Skills Club","Medical Laboratory Research Club"],"culturalClubs":["Student Cultural & Sports Committee"],"communityService":["Blood Donation Camps","Community Optometry Fellowship (Vision Outreach)","Rotary Central TTK-VHS Blood Bank Collaboration"]}'),
