althcare Group)","No NEET Required for Admission (Official)","B.Optom (Bachelor of Optometry)","B.Optom Lateral Entry (For Diploma Holders)","M.Optom (Master of Optometry)"],"canonicalUrl":null,"robots":"index, follow","h1":"Vasan Institute of Ophthalmology & Research, Chennai","openGraph":{"title":"Vasan Institute of Ophthalmology & Research - CollegeShine","description":"Vasan Institute of Ophthalmology & Research, Chennai is a private (vasan foundation — vasan eye care / vasan healthcare group) allied health science college.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Vasan-Institute-of-Ophthalmology-Research-Salem_26_11zon-300x300.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Vasan Institute of Ophthalmology & Research - CollegeShine","description":"Vasan Institute of Ophthalmology & Research, Chennai is a private (vasan foundation — vasan eye care / vasan healthcare group) allied health science college.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Vasan-Institute-of-Ophthalmology-Research-Salem_26_11zon-300x300.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"Vasan Institute of Ophthalmology & Research, Chennai","shortName":"VIOR Chennai","tagline":"Become a Vision Expert","category":"allied-health-science","type":"Private Optometry Institute (Educational Unit of Vasan Foundation)","ownership":"Private (Vasan Foundation — Vasan Eye Care / Vasan Healthcare Group)","established":2010,"location":"West Mambalam, Chennai","district":"Chennai","address":"127, Old Mambalam Road, West Mambalam, Chennai - 600033 (Opposite Annapoorani School)","mapLink":"https://maps.google.com/?q=Vasan+Institute+of+Ophthalmology+Research+West+Mambalam+Chennai","mapQuery":"Vasan+Institute+of+Ophthalmology+Research+West+Mambalam+Chennai","website":"https://vasaninstitute.edu.in/","phone":"044-4860 2955 / +91 95855 48908","email":"mailto:chennai@vasaninstitute.edu.in","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Vasan-Institute-of-Ophthalmology-Research-Salem_26_11zon-300x300.webp","videoUrl":"","affiliation":"B.Optom, B.Optom Lateral Entry & M.Optom programmes affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","accreditation":["Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","Educational Unit of Vasan Foundation (Vasan Eye Care / Vasan Healthcare Group)","No NEET Required for Admission (Official)"],"about":"Vasan Institute of Ophthalmology & Research (VIOR) is an educational unit of Vasan Foundation, the education arm of the Vasan Healthcare Group — one of the world''s largest eye-care networks. Founded to build a pipeline of practice-ready primary eye-care professionals, VIOR offers three optometry programmes affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University: the flagship B.Optom (4 years plus 1-year internship, 20 seats), a B.Optom Lateral Entry route for existing diploma holders (direct 2nd-year entry, 3 years plus internship), and the M.Optom postgraduate programme (2 years, 15 seats).\\n\\nVIOR describes itself as ''clinic-first'' — 60% of the curriculum is practical, with clinical exposure from year one in the refraction lab, hospital internship rotations, and community eye-care camps. The institute operates across two campuses, Chennai (West Mambalam) and Salem, and has produced 9+ graduating batches to date. Faculty include internationally trained optometry educators (alumni of institutions such as BITS Pilani and the University of Houston, per official claims) who are also practising clinicians. A dedicated Careers & Placements cell runs on-campus drives with companies including Bausch + Lomb, Titan Eye+ and Lenskart, and highlights career pathways into hospitals, retail, industry and academia in India, the Middle East and the UK.","highlights":["Educational Unit of Vasan Foundation (Vasan Eye Care Group)","3 Optometry Degree Programmes — B.Optom, B.Optom Lateral Entry, M.Optom","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","No NEET Required for Admission","60% Practical/Clinical Curriculum Exposure","Clinical Training from Year One in Refraction Lab & Hospital Postings","Campus Placement Drives — Bausch + Lomb, Titan Eye+, Lenskart","2 Campuses — Chennai & Salem","9+ Graduating Batches","Faculty Include BITS Pilani & University of Houston Alumni (Official Claim)"],"departments":[{"name":"B.Optom (Bachelor of Optometry)","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Optom Lateral Entry (For Diploma Holders)","level":"UG"},{"name":"M.Optom (Master of Optometry)","level":"PG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Smart Classrooms (Air-Conditioned, Multimedia)"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Library (Journals, Reference & General Books)"},{"icon":"ti-flask","name":"Optics Lab"},{"icon":"ti-eye","name":"Refraction & Clinical Practice Lab"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Computer Lab"},{"icon":"ti-heartbeat","name":"Clinical Network (Internships in Leading Eye Hospitals)"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Private Hostel Assistance Near Campus"},{"icon":"ti-crown","name":"Dedicated Careers & Placements Cell"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Guest Lectures from Industry Experts"},{"icon":"ti-medall","name":"Educational Tours & Industrial Visits"}],"placementRate":90,"avgPackage":"₹2.5 LPA","highestPackage":"₹4.5 LPA","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Check Eligibility","desc":"B.Optom requires +2 with Science; B.Optom Lateral Entry is for existing diploma-in-optometry holders (direct 2nd-year entry); M.Optom requires a relevant bachelor''s degree. No NEET required."},{"title":"Apply Online","desc":"Complete the online application on the official Vasan Institute website — takes about 10 minutes; the admissions team follows up to complete the rest."},{"title":"Submit Personal & Educational Details","desc":"Provide personal details, prior academic records, and upload scanned copies of required documents."},{"title":"Pay Application Fee","desc":"Complete the application fee payment to confirm submission."},{"title":"Counselling & Enrollment","desc":"The admissions team contacts shortlisted candidates to complete counselling, document verification, and final enrollment."}],"scholarships":["Merit-Based Fee Concessions (Case-by-Case, Approx)"],"events":["OATN Walkathon Participation (Community, Mar 2026)","Industrial Visit to Hoya Lens Manufacturing Facility (Feb 2026)","Visit to National Institute for the Empowerment of Persons with Visual Disabilities, NIEPVD (Jan 2026)","Community Eye-Care Camps","Guest Lectures & Seminars"],"distanceInfo":{"airport":"10 km (Chennai International Airport)","railway":"2.4 km (Mambalam Railway Station)","bustand":"1.5 km (T. Nagar Bus Stand)","metro":"3 km (Nearest Chennai Metro Station, approx)","hospital":"Within Vasan Eye Care Clinical Network"},"hostelFeatures":["No In-House Hostel — Institute Assists with Private Hostel Options Near Both Campuses","Private Hostels Nearby (Meals & Laundry Typically Included)"],"technicalClubs":["Optometry Skills & Refraction Club","Vision Research Interest Group"],"culturalClubs":["Student Cultural & Wellness Committee"],"communityService":["OATN Walkathon Participation","Community Eye-Care Screening Camps","Visit to National Institute for the Empowerment of Persons with Visual Disabilities (NIEPVD)","Free Vision Screening for Underprivileged Communities"]}'),
