r. M.G.R. Medical University","accreditation":["Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","Pioneer & Only Institute in Kanniyakumari District for B.Sc MLT & M.Sc MLT","Part of Vivek Institutions Group (Sister Concerns)"],"about":"Vivek Institute of Laboratory Medicine was started in 1993, conducting paramedical courses CMLT and DMLT. From 2011, the institute began running the B.Sc. MLT course, and the M.Sc. MLT course was introduced in 2015 — both affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University. It is the pioneer and only leading institute in Kanniyakumari district conducting B.Sc. MLT and M.Sc. MLT courses with modern facilities.\\n\\nThe institute is housed in a spacious 9,000 sq. ft. building, with a well-stocked library offering internet facility for students. With the growing demand for paramedical professionals in hospitals, laboratories, and research fields, Vivek Institute of Laboratory Medicine has positioned itself to meet the needs of aspiring students seeking a career in medical laboratory technology. The B.Sc. MLT programme has 20 sanctioned seats and runs over 4 years, open to students who have completed 10+2 with Physics, Chemistry, and Biology, or Physics, Chemistry, Botany & Zoology.","highlights":["Pioneer & Only Institute in Kanniyakumari District for B.Sc MLT & M.Sc MLT","Established 1993 — 30+ Years of Paramedical Education","B.Sc MLT — 20 Seats, 4-Year Programme","M.Sc MLT Since 2015","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","9,000 Sq. Ft. Dedicated Building","Well-Stocked Library with Internet Facility","Separate Boys & Girls Hostels on Campus"],"departments":[{"name":"DMLT (Diploma in Medical Laboratory Technology)","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc MLT (Medical Laboratory Technology)","level":"UG"},{"name":"M.Sc MLT (Medical Laboratory Technology)","level":"PG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Library with Internet Facility"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Well-Stocked Reference Library"},{"icon":"ti-flask","name":"Medical Laboratory Technology Labs"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Separate Boys & Girls Hostels"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport Facility"},{"icon":"ti-heartbeat","name":"Clinical Training Tie-Ups"},{"icon":"ti-crown","name":"Placement Support"},{"icon":"ti-cpu","name":"Modern Lab Equipment"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports & Recreation"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Seminar Halls"},{"icon":"ti-medall","name":"Institute Activities & Events Programme"},{"icon":"ti-heart","name":"9,000 Sq. Ft. Campus Building"}],"placementRate":82,"avgPackage":"₹2.3 LPA","highestPackage":"₹4.5 LPA","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Meet Eligibility Criteria","desc":"For B.Sc MLT: candidates must have passed 10+2 with Physics, Chemistry, and Biology, or Physics, Chemistry, Botany & Zoology."},{"title":"Apply to the Institute","desc":"Submit an application for the desired course (DMLT, B.Sc MLT, or M.Sc MLT) through the institute''s admissions office."},{"title":"Document Verification","desc":"Submit original academic and identity documents for verification."},{"title":"Merit-Based Admission","desc":"Seats are allotted based on merit and eligibility as per institute and university norms (20 seats for B.Sc MLT)."},{"title":"Fee Payment & Enrollment","desc":"Complete fee payment and reporting formalities to confirm admission."}],"scholarships":["Merit-Based Fee Concessions (as per Institute Policy)"],"events":["Institute Activities Programme","Annual Day Celebrations","Lab Skills Workshops","Guest Lectures by Industry Experts"],"distanceInfo":{"airport":"25 km (Thiruvananthapuram International Airport)","railway":"1 km (Nagercoil Junction)","bustand":"2 km","metro":"N/A","hospital":"5 km (Clinical Training Tie-Up Hospitals)"},"hostelFeatures":["Separate Boys & Girls Hostels","All Facilities Attached (per Official Site)","Mess Facility"],"technicalClubs":["Medical Laboratory Technology Skill Club","Clinical Research Club"],"culturalClubs":["Cul