y","B.Sc Critical Care Technology","B.Sc Operation Theatre and Anesthesia Technology","B.Sc Physician Assistant","B.Sc Radiography and Imaging Technology"],"canonicalUrl":null,"robots":"index, follow","h1":"Ganga College of Nursing (Ganga Institute of Health Sciences), Coimbatore","openGraph":{"title":"Ganga College of Nursing (Ganga Institute of - CollegeShine","description":"Ganga College of Nursing (Ganga Institute of Health Sciences), Coimbatore is a private (ganga hospital trust) allied health science college in.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/ganga-college-of-nursing.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Ganga College of Nursing (Ganga Institute of - CollegeShine","description":"Ganga College of Nursing (Ganga Institute of Health Sciences), Coimbatore is a private (ganga hospital trust) allied health science college in.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/ganga-college-of-nursing.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"Ganga College of Nursing (Ganga Institute of Health Sciences), Coimbatore","shortName":"Ganga College of Nursing","tagline":"Serving with Compassion and Commitment","category":"allied-health-science","type":"Private Health Sciences Institute (Nursing & Allied Health)","ownership":"Private (Ganga Hospital Trust)","established":1978,"location":"Vattamalaipalayam, Coimbatore","district":"Coimbatore","address":"SF No.442, Vattamalaipalayam, NGGO Colony Post, Coimbatore - 641022, Tamil Nadu, India","mapLink":"https://maps.google.com/?q=Ganga+Institute+of+Health+Sciences+Coimbatore","mapQuery":"Ganga+Institute+of+Health+Sciences+Coimbatore","website":"https://gcon.edu.in/","phone":"0422-3501755","email":"mailto:admin@gcon.edu.in","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/ganga-college-of-nursing.webp","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ylM9zkgtn28?si=T_NlyiU__r4RTJhf","affiliation":"Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University; nursing programmes recognized by the Indian Nursing Council (INC) and Tamil Nadu Nurses & Midwives Council","accreditation":["Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","Recognized by Indian Nursing Council (INC)","Recognized by Tamil Nadu Nurses & Midwives Council","1,050+ Alumni (Gangites)","Attached to Ganga Hospital, Coimbatore"],"about":"Ganga Institute of Health Sciences (GIHS) comprises the School of Nursing and College of Nursing, situated in Vattamalaipalayam, 8 km from Ganga Hospital, Coimbatore. Ganga Hospital itself traces back to 1978, when it was started as Ganga Nursing Home by Dr. J.G. Shanmuganathan. The academic block is a spacious 54,000 sq. ft. structure encompassing classrooms, pre-clinical labs, a library, and an auditorium, set within a 13.42-acre campus, of which 49,000 sq. ft. houses separate Boys and Girls Hostels.\\n\\nGIHS offers nursing programmes including GNM, B.Sc Nursing, Post-Basic B.Sc Nursing, and M.Sc Nursing, alongside a strong Allied Health Sciences (AHS) wing with six B.Sc./M.Sc. programmes: Accident & Emergency Care Technology, Critical Care Technology, Operation Theatre & Anesthesia Technology, Physician Assistant, Radiography & Imaging Technology, and Medical Laboratory Technology, plus M.Sc. Clinical Nutrition — all 4-year UG programmes (except the 2-year-plus-6-month M.Sc.) affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University. With 40+ faculty, 10+ courses, and 1,050+ alumni (''Gangites''), the institute emphasizes academic and clinical excellence, research and innovation, and holistic student development.","highlights":["6 B.Sc./M.Sc. Allied Health Science Programmes","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","13.42-Acre Campus — 54,000 Sq. Ft. Academic Block","Attached to Ganga Hospital, Coimbatore (8 km away)","40+ Faculty, 10+ Courses, 1,050+ Alumni","Separate Boys & Girls Hostels — 49,000 Sq. Ft.","Pre-Clinical Labs, Library & Auditorium On Campus","Strong Global Association & Community Services Programme"],"departments":[{"name":"B.Sc Accident & Emergency Care Technology","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc Critical Care Technology","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc Operation Theatre and Anesthesia Technology","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc Physician Assistant","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc Radiography and Imaging Technology","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc Medical Laboratory Technology","level":"UG"},{"name":"M.Sc Clinical Nutrition","level":"PG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Network"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-flask","name":"Pre-Clinical Labs"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Separate Boys & Girls Hostels (49,000 Sq. Ft.)"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport Facility"},{"icon":"ti-heartbeat","name":"Attached to Ganga Hospital, Coimbatore"},{"icon":"ti-crown","name":"Auditorium"},{"icon":"ti-heart","name":"Global Association Programme"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports & Recreation"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Conference Facilities"},{"icon":"ti-cpu","name":"Smart Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-medall","name":"Community Services Programme"}],"placementRate":88,"avgPackage":"₹2.8 LPA","highestPackage":"₹5.5 LPA","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Meet Eligibility Criteria","desc":"For AHS B.Sc programmes: candidates must be 17-35 years old with the relevant +2 qualification. For nursing programmes: specific age (17+) and marks criteria apply (40-50% depending on the course)."},{"title":"Submit Admission Form","desc":"Complete the admission form available on the official website (gcon.edu.in/admission)."},{"title":"Enquiry & Counselling","desc":"Prospective students can submit an enquiry form for guidance on course selection and eligibility."},{"title":"Document Verification & Fee Payment","desc":"Submit required documents and complete fee payment via online payment or at the institute."},{"title":"Reporting & Enrollment","desc":"Report to the institute with original documents to confirm admission into the chosen programme."}],"scholarships":["Financial Services & Fee Assistance (as per Institute Policy)"],"events":["Neuro Frontiers (Annual Conference)","Graduation Ceremony","Conferences & Workshops","Upcoming Events Programme"],"distanceInfo":{"airport":"12 km (Coimbatore International Airport)","railway":"10 km (Coimbatore Junction)","bustand":"9 km","metro":"N/A","hospital":"8 km (Ganga Hospital)"},"hostelFeatures":["Separate Boys & Girls Hostels","49,000 Sq. Ft. Hostel Block","Mess Facility","24x7 Security"],"technicalClubs":["Clinical Skill Development Club","Allied Health Research Club"],"culturalClubs":["Dance Club","Music Club","Fine Arts Club"],"communityService":["Community Services Programme","Health Awareness Camps","Free Diagnostic & Screening Camps"]}'),
('karpaga-vinayaga-institute-of-medical-sciences-ahs','karpaga-vinayaga-institute-of-medical-sciences-ahs','Karpaga Vinayaga Institute of Medical Sciences & Research Centre, Maduranthagam','KIMS & RC','allied-health-science','Private Medical College & Allied Health Sciences Institute','Private (Karpaga Vinayaga Educational Group)','2001','Maduranthagam','Chengalpattu','NH-45 (GST Road), Maduranthagam, Chengalpattu District, Tamil Nadu','https://maps.google.com/?q=Karpaga+Vinayaga+Institute+of+Medical+Sciences+Maduranthagam','https://kims.edu.in/','044-27593232','mailto:info@kims.edu.in','https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Karpaga-Vinayaga-Institute-of-Medical-Sciences.webp','Karpaga Vinayaga Institute of Medical Sciences & - CollegeShine','Karpaga Vinayaga Institute of Medical Sciences & Research Centre, Maduranthagam is a private (karpaga vinayaga educational group) allied health science.',NULL, '{"id":"karpaga-vinayaga-institute-of-medical-sciences-ahs","seo":{"metaTitle":"Karpaga Vinayaga Institute of Medical Sciences & - CollegeShine","metaDescription":"Karpaga Vinayaga Institute of Medical Sciences & Research Centre, Maduranthagam is a private (karpaga vinayaga educational group) allied health science.","metaKeywords":["Karpaga Vinayaga Institute of Medical Sciences & Research Centre","Maduranthagam","KIMS & RC","Karpaga Vinayaga Institute of Medical Sciences & Research Centre","Maduranthagam admission 2026","Karpaga Vinayaga Institute of Medical Sciences & Research Centre","Maduranthagam fees","Karpaga Vinayaga Institute of Medical Sciences & Research Centre","Maduranthagam courses","Allied Health Science colleges in Chengalpattu","Maduranthagam","Chengalpattu","Allied Health Science","Private (Karpaga Vinayaga Educational Group)","Private Medical College & Allied Health Sciences Institute","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","Recognized by National Medical Commission (NMC)","NAAC Accredited (Cycle II)","NABH Certified Hospital","B.Sc. Radiography and Imaging Technology (RIT)","B.Sc. Operation Theatre and Anaesthesia Technology (OTAT)","B.Sc. Medical Lab Technology (MLT)","B.Sc. Medical Record Sciences (MRS)","B.Sc. (Hons.) Women''s Health","Hygiene and Disease Prevention"],"canonicalUrl":null,"robots":"index, follow","h1":"Karpaga Vinayaga Institute of Medical Sciences & Research Centre, Maduranthagam","openGraph":{"title":"Karpaga Vinayaga Institute of Medical Sciences & - CollegeShine","description":"Karpaga Vinayaga Institute of Medical Sciences & Research Centre, Maduranthagam is a private (karpaga vinayaga educational group) allied health science.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Karpaga-Vinayaga-Institute-of-Medical-Sciences.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Karpaga Vinayaga Institute of Medical Sciences & - CollegeShine","description":"Karpaga Vinayaga Institute of Medical Sciences & Research Centre, Maduranthagam is a private (karpaga vinayaga educational group) allied health science.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Karpaga-Vinayaga-Institute-of-Medical-Sciences.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"Karpaga Vinayaga Institute of Medical Sciences & Research Centre, Maduranthagam","shortName":"KIMS & RC","tagline":"Medical & Allied Health Sciences at One Place","category":"allied-health-science","type":"Private Medical College & Allied Health Sciences Institute","ownership":"Private (Karpaga Vinayaga Educational Group)","established":2001,"location":"Maduranthagam","district":"Chengalpattu","address":"NH-45 (GST Road), Maduranthagam, Chengalpattu District, Tamil Nadu","mapLink":"https://maps.google.com/?q=Karpaga+Vinayaga+Institute+of+Medical+Sciences+Maduranthagam","mapQuery":"Karpaga+Vinayaga+Institute+of+Medical+Sciences+Maduranthagam","website":"https://kims.edu.in/","phone":"044-27593232","email":"mailto:info@kims.edu.in","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Karpaga-Vinayaga-Institute-of-Medical-Sciences.webp","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/iwqDsh-hM2g?si=QuJAJy_489mVd3e","affiliation":"Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University; recognized by the National Medical Commission (NMC); NAAC Accredited; NABH Certified Hospital","accreditation":["Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","Recognized by National Medical Commission (NMC)","NAAC Accredited (Cycle II)","NABH Certified Hospital","NABL Certified Laboratory (NABTCL)","SIRO (Scientific and Industrial Research Organisation) Recognized","UNESCO Bioethics Center"],"about":"Karpaga Vinayaga Institute of Medical Sciences & Research Centre (KIMS & RC), Maduranthagam, is spread over 30.76 acres of land on NH-45 (GST Road), offering Medical and Allied Health Sciences courses at one place. The institute operates a well-established 650-bed multi-super-speciality hospital with hi-tech infrastructure and modern equipment, including state-of-the-art intensive medical, surgical, cardiac, neonatal, and burns care units.\\n\\nOn the Allied Health Sciences side, KIMS & RC offers undergraduate programmes in Radiography and Imaging Technology (RIT), Operation Theatre and Anaesthesia Technology (OTAT), Medical Lab Technology (MLT), and Medical Record Sciences (MRS) — all 3 years plus 1-year internship — alongside a B.Sc. (Hons.) in Women''s Health, Hygiene and Disease Prevention (4 years). At the postgraduate level, the institute offers a 2-year M.Sc. in Food and Nutrition Technology and unique 5-year Integrated M.Sc. programmes in Cardiac Technology and Renal Dialysis Technology, both with exit options (B.Sc. after 3 years, B.Sc. Hons. after 4 years). The institute is NAAC accredited, NABH certified, and holds NABL laboratory certification, alongside SIRO recognition and a UNESCO Bioethics Center.","highlights":["4 AHS UG Courses — RIT, OTAT, MLT, MRS (3 Years + 1-Year Internship)","B.Sc. (Hons.) Women''s Health, Hygiene and Disease Prevention — 4 Years","5-Year Integrated M.Sc. in Cardiac Technology & Renal Dialysis Technology with Exit Options","M.Sc. in Food and Nutrition Technology — 2 Years","650-Bed Multi-Super-Speciality Hospital","30.76-Acre Campus on NH-45 (GST Road)","NAAC Accredited, NABH Certified, NABL Laboratory Certified","SIRO Recognized & UNESCO Bioethics Center","Part of Karpaga Vinayaga Educational Group (Engineering, Dental, Nursing, Pharmacy)"],"departments":[{"name":"B.Sc. Radiography and Imaging Technology (RIT)","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Operation Theatre and Anaesthesia Technology (OTAT)","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Medical Lab Technology (MLT)","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Medical Record Sciences (MRS)","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. (Hons.) Women''s Health, Hygiene and Disease Prevention","level":"UG"},{"name":"M.Sc. Food and Nutrition Technology","level":"PG"},{"name":"Integrated M.Sc. Cardiac Technology","level":"PG"},{"name":"Integrated M.Sc. Renal Dialysis Technology","level":"PG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus-Wide Wi-Fi"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Extensive Digital & Physical Library"},{"icon":"ti-flask","name":"Well-Equipped Laboratories"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"On-Campus Hostels"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transportation Facility"},{"icon":"ti-heartbeat","name":"650-Bed Multi-Super-Speciality Hospital"},{"icon":"ti-crown","name":"2,000-Capacity Air-Conditioned Auditorium"},{"icon":"ti-heart","name":"Ambulance Services"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports & Fitness Centers"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Lecture Halls with Audio-Visual Equipment"},{"icon":"ti-cpu","name":"Skill Lab"},{"icon":"ti-medall","name":"Banking & ATM Facilities On Campus"}],"placementRate":78,"avgPackage":"₹3 LPA","highestPackage":"₹6 LPA","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Meet Eligibility Criteria","desc":"Eligibility varies by course; UG AHS programmes generally require 10+2 with Physics, Chemistry, Biology; PG/Integrated M.Sc. programmes have their own qualifying criteria."},{"title":"Apply Through Admissions Portal","desc":"Complete the application process via the official KIMS admissions channel for the desired course."},{"title":"Document Verification","desc":"Submit academic and identity documents for verification at the institute."},{"title":"Merit-Based / Counselling-Based Selection","desc":"Seats are allotted based on merit, and for MBBS, through KIMS-MCC Counselling as per the current admission cycle."},{"title":"Fee Payment & Enrollment","desc":"Complete fee payment through the official online payment portal and report to campus for enrollment."}],"scholarships":["Institutional Scholarship (per Student Support > Scholarship page)"],"events":["Affinity (Annual Cultural & Sports Fest)","CME/Workshops (e.g., Tuberculosis, Trauma Management, Autism Spectrum Disorders)","Teacher''s Day","Independence Day Celebrations","Extension & Outreach Health Camps","Day of Celebration Programmes"],"distanceInfo":{"airport":"55 km (Chennai International Airport)","railway":"3 km (Maduranthagam Railway Station)","bustand":"2 km","metro":"N/A","hospital":"On Campus"},"hostelFeatures":["On-Campus Hostel Accommodation","Wi-Fi","Laundry Facilities","Meal Plans"],"technicalClubs":["Academic Club","Medical Education Unit (MEU) Student Activities"],"culturalClubs":["Cultural and Sports Club","Student Bioethics Wing"],"communityService":["Extension & Outreach Health Education Programs","Health Check-Up Camps","Health Awareness Programs","YRC (Youth Red Cross)","KIMS Blood Donor Club"]}'),
('doctors-institute-of-laboratory-science-trichy','doctors-institute-of-laboratory-science-trichy','Doctors'' Institute of Laboratory Science, Tiruchirappalli','Doctors'' Institute of Laboratory Science','allied-health-science','Private Allied Health Sciences Institute','Private','2005','Palakarai, Tiruchirappalli','Tiruchirappalli','Opposite to Doctors Lab, Palakarai, Tiruchirappalli, Tamil Nadu','https://maps.google.com/?q=Doctors+Institute+of+Laboratory+Science+Palakarai+Trichy','','0431-2460000','mailto:doctorsinstitutelab@gmail.com','https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/doctors-institute-of-laboratory-science-trichy.webp','Doctors'' Institute of Laboratory Science - CollegeShine','Doctors'' Institute of Laboratory Science, Tiruchirappalli is a private allied health science college in Palakarai, Tiruchirappalli established in 2005.',NULL, '{"id":"doctors-institute-of-laboratory-science-trichy","seo":{"metaTitle":"Doctors'' Institute of Laboratory Science - CollegeShine","metaDescription":"Doctors'' Institute of Laboratory Science, Tiruchirappalli is a private allied health science college in Palakarai, Tiruchirappalli established in 2005.","metaKeywords":["Doctors'' Institute of Laboratory Science","Tiruchirappalli","Doctors'' Institute of Laboratory Science","Doctors'' Institute of Laboratory Science","Tiruchirappalli admission 2026","Doctors'' Institute of Laboratory Science","Tiruchirappalli fees","Doctors'' Institute of Laboratory Science","Tiruchirappalli courses","Allied Health Science colleges in Tiruchirappalli","Palakarai","Tiruchirappalli","Tiruchirappalli","Allied Health Science","Private","Private Allied Health Sciences Institute","Institute Code 554 (per third-party education directory listings)","DMLT (Diploma in Medical Laboratory Technology)","CMLT (Certificate in Medical Laboratory Technology)"],"canonicalUrl":null,"robots":"index, follow","h1":"Doctors'' Institute of Laboratory Science, Tiruchirappalli","openGraph":{"title":"Doctors'' Institute of Laboratory Science - CollegeShine","description":"Doctors'' Institute of Laboratory Science, Tiruchirappalli is a private allied health science college in Palakarai, Tiruchirappalli established in 2005.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/doctors-institute-of-laboratory-science-trichy.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Doctors'' Institute of Laboratory Science - CollegeShine","description":"Doctors'' Institute of Laboratory Science, Tiruchirappalli is a private allied health science college in Palakarai, Tiruchirappalli established in 2005.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/doctors-institute-of-laboratory-science-trichy.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"Doctors'' Institute of Laboratory Science, Tiruchirappalli","shortName":"Doctors'' Institute of Laboratory Science","tagline":"Training Skilled Laboratory Professionals","category":"allied-health-science","type":"Private Allied Health Sciences Institute","ownership":"Private","established":2005,"location":"Palakarai, Tiruchirappalli","district":"Tiruchirappalli","address":"Opposite to Doctors Lab, Palakarai, Tiruchirappalli, Tamil Nadu","mapLink":"https://maps.google.com/?q=Doctors+Institute+of+Laboratory+Science+Palakarai+Trichy","mapQuery":"Doctors+Institute+of+Laboratory+Science+Palakarai+Trichy","website":"","phone":"0431-2460000","email":"mailto:doctorsinstitutelab@gmail.com","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/doctors-institute-of-laboratory-science-trichy.webp","videoUrl":"","affiliation":"Institute Code 554 (per third-party listing); paramedical courses typically registered under Tamil Nadu government-recognized DMLT/CMLT frameworks","accreditation":["Institute Code 554 (per third-party education directory listings)"],"about":"Doctors'' Institute of Laborato