t 10th pass."},{"title":"Visit or Contact the Institute","desc":"Since no official website is available, prospective students should contact or visit the institute directly at its Palakarai location for current course and admission details."},{"title":"Document Submission","desc":"Submit academic certificates and identity proof as required by the institute."},{"title":"Fee Payment & Enrollment","desc":"Complete fee payment to confirm admission into the desired course."}],"scholarships":["Fee Concessions for Deserving Students (as per Institute Discretion)"],"events":["Annual Practical Skills Assessment","Guest Sessions by Local Lab Professionals"],"distanceInfo":{"airport":"6 km (Tiruchirappalli International Airport)","railway":"2 km (Trichy Junction)","bustand":"2 km","metro":"N/A","hospital":"On Site (Adjacent to Doctors Lab)"},"hostelFeatures":["Day-Scholar Institute — No Hostel Facility"],"technicalClubs":["Informal Peer Study Group"],"culturalClubs":[],"communityService":["Occasional Free Health Screening Support (via Adjacent Doctors Lab)"]}'),
