m2!1sen!2sin","mapQuery":"Srinivasan+Medical+College+and+Hospital+Samayapuram+Tiruchirappalli","website":"https://srinivasanmedicalcollege.org","phone":"0431-2675555","email":"mailto:smch5353@gmail.com","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Srinivasan-Institute-Of-Medical-Sciences-Tiruchirappalli-collegeshine.webp","videoUrl":"","affiliation":"Under Dhanalakshmi Srinivasan Institute of Research and Technology (Deemed to be University)","accreditation":["Recognized by National Medical Commission (NMC)","Deemed to be University Status (UGC)","Dhanalakshmi Srinivasan Charitable and Educational Trust Institution","NABH-Track Teaching Hospital (Approx., Not Formally Confirmed)"],"about":"Srinivasan Medical College and Hospital (SMCH) was established by the Dhanalakshmi Srinivasan Charitable and Educational Trust in 2021 as a private, not-for-profit, self-financing institution dedicated to serving society as a centre of excellence in medical education and healthcare. It operates under Dhanalakshmi Srinivasan Institute of Research and Technology, a Deemed to be University, under the founding leadership of Shri. A. Srinivasan, Founder & Managing Trustee of the Trust and first Chancellor of the University.\\n\\nStudents receive hands-on training in wards and out-patient departments over five years, working directly with real patients to build skills in history-taking, examination, differential diagnosis, and patient management, followed by a 12-month rotating internship across specialties. The infrastructure spans over two million square feet of constructed space, including fully air-conditioned smart classrooms, modern laboratories, and the Central Library Learning Centre — described as one of the largest medical libraries in the region. The 25-acre green campus functions as a self-contained township with colleges, a medical centre, staff and student housing, conference facilities, playgrounds, and multi-cuisine restaurants.","highlights":["Establishe