gy (B.AOTT)","B.Sc Physician Associate (BPA)","B.Sc Emergency Medical Technologist (BEMT)"],"canonicalUrl":null,"robots":"index, follow","h1":"Santhi College of Health Sciences","openGraph":{"title":"Santhi College of Health Sciences | Krishnagiri - CollegeShine","description":"Santhi College of Health Sciences is a private allied health science college in Hosur, Krishnagiri established in 2009. A Valid Path for Dream Career Check.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Santhi-Paramedical-Institute-Krishnagiri-collegeshine.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Santhi College of Health Sciences | Krishnagiri - CollegeShine","description":"Santhi College of Health Sciences is a private allied health science college in Hosur, Krishnagiri established in 2009. A Valid Path for Dream Career Check.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Santhi-Paramedical-Institute-Krishnagiri-collegeshine.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"Santhi College of Health Sciences","shortName":"Santhi College","tagline":"A Valid Path for Dream Career","category":"allied-health-science","type":"Private Self-Financing Paramedical College","ownership":"Private","established":2009,"location":"Hosur, Krishnagiri","district":"Krishnagiri","address":"Behind SBI, Near Chennai Silks, Opp. Lal, Mookandapalli, Sipcot 1, Hosur - 635126, Krishnagiri District, Tamil Nadu","mapLink":"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d15565.826003392443!2d77.79718916977542!3d12.748839000000011!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3bae7179d5bee847%3A0x7f5d1e59d4491756!2sSanthi+College+of+Health+Sciences+Hosur+(Paramedical+Degree+Courses%2FParamedical+College)!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1536216145387","mapQuery":"Santhi+College+of+Health+Sciences+Hosur+Krishnagiri","website":"http://santhicollege.com","phone":"04344-278777","email":"mailto:principal@santhicollege.com","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Santhi-Paramedical-Institute-Krishnagiri-collegeshine.webp","videoUrl":"","affiliation":"Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","accreditation":["Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","Recognized Paramedical Training Institution, Tamil Nadu"],"about":"Santhi College of Health Sciences was established in 2009 as Santhi Paramedical Institute, initially providing training in various diploma paramedical courses. The college is affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University and is led by Chairman Dr. B.M. Sundararajulu (MBBS, FCCP) and Director Dr. Saroja (MBBS, DGO).\\n\\nThe institution is supported by three parent hospitals with 50 beds each — Santhi Hospital & Jananam Fertility Centre in Hosur, B.M.S. Multi-Specialty Hospital in Hosur, and Vijayalakshmi Nursing Home in Denkanikottai — offering hands-on clinical exposure across casualty, medical-surgical, orthopedic, pediatric, OBG, ENT, ICU, IVF lab, major OT, trauma care, endoscopic surgery, laparoscopy, and diagnostic laboratory services. Students also receive in-course hospital training at partner hospitals across Hosur and Trichy, including B.M.S Hospital, Gunam Hospital, Varam Hospital, Janaraksha Multispeciality Hospital, and Star KIMS Hospital. The college has trained approximately 60 students annually since 2009 under diploma paramedical courses, and around 20 students annually under the PVP (Placement-linked Vocational Programme), with placement support arranged for each candidate. The college also conducts medical camps in villages surrounding Hosur and within the hospital campus.","highlights":["Established 2009 as Santhi Paramedical Institute","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","Backed by 3 Parent Hospitals (150 Beds Combined)","In-Course Hospital Training at 10+ Partner Hospitals","Smart Classrooms with