)","BNYS (Bachelor of Naturopathy & Yogic Sciences)","B.Sc Cardiac Technology","B.Sc Radiography & Imaging"],"canonicalUrl":null,"robots":"index, follow","h1":"St. Mary''s College of Health Sciences (St. Mary''s Group of Institutions)","openGraph":{"title":"St. Mary''s College of Health Sciences (St. Mary''s - CollegeShine","description":"St. Mary''s College of Health Sciences (St. Mary''s Group of Institutions) is a private allied health science college in Shenkottai, Tenkasi District (Campus.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/st-marys-college-of-health-science-tenkasi-collegeshine.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"St. Mary''s College of Health Sciences (St. Mary''s - CollegeShine","description":"St. Mary''s College of Health Sciences (St. Mary''s Group of Institutions) is a private allied health science college in Shenkottai, Tenkasi District (Campus.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/st-marys-college-of-health-science-tenkasi-collegeshine.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"St. Mary''s College of Health Sciences (St. Mary''s Group of Institutions)","shortName":"St. Mary''s College","tagline":"Become the Heartbeat of Tomorrow","category":"allied-health-science","type":"Private Self-Financing College","ownership":"Private","established":2025,"location":"Shenkottai, Tenkasi District (Campus 1); Vasudevanallur, Kollam-Madurai Road (Campus 2)","district":"Tenkasi","address":"Thenpothai, Panpoli P.O., Shenkottai, Tenkasi District, Tamil Nadu - 627807","mapLink":"https://maps.google.com/?q=St+Mary''s+College+of+Health+Sciences+Shenkottai+Tenkasi","mapQuery":"St+Marys+College+of+Health+Sciences+Shenkottai+Tenkasi","website":"https://stmaryscolleges.com","phone":"04633-233222","email":"mailto:stmarys198@gmail.com","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uplo