","description":"Dindigul Shifa College of Health Sciences is a private allied health science college in Dindigul established in 2023. Shaping the Future of Healthcare with.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Dindigul-Shifa-College-of-Health-Science-Dindigul-collegeshine.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Dindigul Shifa College of Health Sciences - CollegeShine","description":"Dindigul Shifa College of Health Sciences is a private allied health science college in Dindigul established in 2023. Shaping the Future of Healthcare with.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Dindigul-Shifa-College-of-Health-Science-Dindigul-collegeshine.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"Dindigul Shifa College of Health Sciences","shortName":"Shifa College Dindigul","tagline":"Shaping the Future of Healthcare with Skill, Compassion & Excellence","category":"allied-health-science","type":"Private Self-Financing Paramedical College","ownership":"Private","established":2023,"location":"Dindigul","district":"Dindigul","address":"Chennamanayakkan Patty Road, Near Collector Office, Dindigul - 624004, Tamil Nadu","mapLink":"https://maps.google.com/?q=Dindigul+Shifa+College+of+Health+Sciences+Dindigul","mapQuery":"Dindigul+Shifa+College+of+Health+Sciences+Dindigul","website":"https://www.shifaparamedicalcollege.com","phone":"+91 8754352309","email":"mailto:shifadglchs@gmail.com","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Dindigul-Shifa-College-of-Health-Science-Dindigul-collegeshine.webp","videoUrl":"","affiliation":"Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University, Chennai","accreditation":["Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University, Chennai","Recognized Allied Health Sciences Institution, Tamil Nadu"],"about":"Dindigul Shifa College of Health Sciences (DSCHS) is a premier Allied Health Sciences institution in Tamil Nadu, chaired by Dr. S. Peer Mohammad. The college is committed to meeting the evolving challenges of healthcare through industry-relevant diploma and degree programs that combine academic excellence with real-world clinical training. Allied health professionals trained here play a key role in disease prevention, diagnosis, treatment, and rehabilitation, working closely with doctors and nurses to support patients of all ages.\\n\\nThe college is affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University, Chennai, and currently offers three undergraduate programmes: B.Sc Medical Laboratory Technology, B.Sc Operation Theatre & Anaesthesia Technology, and B.Sc Radiography & Imaging Technology — each a 3-year course followed by a 1-year internship, with more courses planned for upcoming academic years. Students train at the college''s own full-fledged multispeciality hospital, which includes departments in Gynecology, Infertility & IVF, General Surgery, Orthopaedics, and Emergency Medicine, three modern operation theatres, a fully functional ICU, and specialized units for delivery and postnatal care — allowing complete in-house clinical exposure without needing external placements for practical training. The college reports 100% results in university examinations and offers a digital library with HELINET e-learning access.","highlights":["Chaired by Dr. S. Peer Mohammad","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","100% Results in University Examinations","In-House Multispeciality Teaching Hospital (3 OTs, Full ICU)","Clinical Training in Top Hospitals of Dindigul & Madurai","Digital Library with HELINET E-Learning Access","Excellent Placement in Leading Hospitals","Industry-Aligned Curriculum with Practical Exposure","AC Seminar Hall & Conference Hall","8 Placement Partner Hospitals/Organizations"],"departments":[{"name":"B.Sc Medical Laboratory Technology (MLT)","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc Operation Theatre & Anaesthesia Technology (OT & AT)","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc Radiography & Imaging Technology","level":"UG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-cpu","name":"Classroom"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"AC Seminar Hall"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Conference Hall"},{"icon":"ti-flask","name":"Laboratories"},{"icon":"ti-heartbeat","name":"Clinical Training (In-House Multispeciality Hospital)"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Digital Library (HELINET E-Learning Access)"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Hostel"}],"placementRate":70,"avgPackage":"₹1.8 LPA","highestPackage":"₹3.2 LPA","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Submit Admission Enquiry","desc":"Prospective students fill out the Admission Enquiry form on the official website to express interest in a programme."},{"title":"Check Eligibility","desc":"Candidates confirm eligibility (typically 10+2 with Physics, Chemistry, Biology) for their chosen B.Sc paramedical programme."},{"title":"Document Verification","desc":"Academic records, identity and category certificates are submitted and verified at the time of admission."},{"title":"Scholarship Check (If Applicable)","desc":"Eligible candidates review the college''s Scholarship Details page to check for applicable fee concessions."},{"title":"Seat Confirmation & Enrollment","desc":"Selected candidates confirm their seat by paying the prescribed fees and completing enrollment formalities."}],"scholarships":["Scholarship Programme Available (See Official Scholarship Details Page)","First Graduate Scholarship","BC / MBC Scholarship","SC / ST Scholarship"],"events":["Distinction Student Recognition Programme","Clinical Skills Workshops","Guest Lectures by Healthcare Professionals"],"distanceInfo":{"airport":"Approx. 65-70 km (Madurai Airport, nearest major airport)","railway":"Approx. 2-3 km (Dindigul Railway Junction)","bustand":"Approx. 1-2 km (Dindigul Bus Stand)","metro":"N/A","hospital":"On Campus (In-House Multispeciality Teaching Hospital)"},"hostelFeatures":["Separate Boys & Girls Hostels (Assumed)","Mess Facility","Study Rooms","Basic Recreation Areas","Security"],"technicalClubs":["Medical Lab Technology Club","OT & Anaesthesia Skills Club","Radiography & Imaging Club"],"culturalClubs":["Dance Club","Music Club","Fine Arts Club"],"communityService":["NSS","Health Awareness Camps","Free Diagnostic Camps (Via In-House Hospital)","Blood Donation Camps"]}'),
('sir-issac-newton-College-of-Allied-Health-Science','sir-issac-newton-college-of-allied-health-science','Sir Issac Newton College Of Physiotherapy','SINC Physiotherapy','allied-health-science','Private Self-Financing College','Private','2018','Pappakovil / Andhanapet, Nagapattinam','Nagapattinam','Velankanni Road, Pappakovil, Andhanapet Post, Nagapattinam - 611102, Tamil Nadu','https://maps.google.com/?q=Sir+Issac+Newton+College+of+Physiotherapy+Nagapattinam','https://www.sincp.in','Not Published (Contact via Official Website Enquiry Form)','mailto:info@sincp.in','https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/sir-issac-newton-college-of-physiotherapy.webp','Sir Issac Newton College Of Physiotherapy - CollegeShine','Sir Issac Newton College Of Physiotherapy is a private allied health science college in Pappakovil / Andhanapet, Nagapattinam established in 2018.',NULL, '{"id":"sir-issac-newton-College-of-Allied-Health-Science","seo":{"metaTitle":"Sir Issac Newton College Of Physiotherapy - CollegeShine","metaDescription":"Sir Issac Newton College Of Physiotherapy is a private allied health science college in Pappakovil / Andhanapet, Nagapattinam established in 2018.","metaKeywords":["Sir Issac Newton College Of Physiotherapy","SINC Physiotherapy","Sir Issac Newton College Of Physiotherapy admission 2026","Sir Issac Newton College Of Physiotherapy fees","Sir Issac Newton College Of Physiotherapy courses","Allied Health Science colleges in Nagapattinam","Pappakovil / Andhanapet","Nagapattinam","Nagapattinam","Allied Health Science","Private","Private Self-Financing College","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","Chennai","Accredited by Indian Association of Physiotherapists","Part of Sir Issac Newton Group of Educational Institutions","BPT (Bachelor of Physiotherapy)","MPT (Master of Physiotherapy)","DPT (Doctor of Physiotherapy)"],"canonicalUrl":null,"robots":"index, follow","h1":"Sir Issac Newton College Of Physiotherapy","openGraph":{"tit