dical University, Chennai","Accredited by Indian Association of Physiotherapists","Part of Sir Issac Newton Group of Educational Institutions"],"about":"Sir Issac Newton College Of Physiotherapy is a private institution located in Pappakovil, Andhanapet Post, Nagapattinam, and is part of the broader Sir Issac Newton Group of Educational Institutions, which operates several academic establishments across Nagapattinam district including engineering, arts and science, and naturopathy & yoga medical colleges. The college is affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University, Chennai, and accredited by the Indian Association of Physiotherapists.\\n\\nThe college offers BPT (Bachelor of Physiotherapy), MPT (Master of Physiotherapy), and DPT (Doctor of Physiotherapy) programmes, with the BPT programme spanning 4 years plus a 6-month internship. Its modern infrastructure includes well-equipped classrooms, specialized physiotherapy laboratories, on-campus clinics, a well-stocked library, gymnasium and exercise areas, computer labs, sports facilities, a cafeteria, Wi-Fi connectivity, and campus security. The college is uniquely positioned near renowned pilgrimage sites — the Velankanni Basilica, Nagore Dargah, and Sikkal Singaravelar Temple — creating a culturally rich and tranquil learning environment. The institution''s stated vision is to impart not only career-oriented skills but also the virtues of humanity, humanness, honesty, and courage in its students.","highlights":["Part of Sir Issac Newton Group of Educational Institutions","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","Accredited by Indian Association of Physiotherapists","Offers BPT, MPT & DPT Programmes","On-Campus Physiotherapy Clinics","Gymnasium & Exercise Areas","Located Near Major Pilgrimage Sites (Velankanni, Nagore, Sikkal)","Modern Labs, Classrooms & Library","Wi-Fi Enabled Campus with Security"],"departments":[{"name":"BPT (Bachelor of Physiotherapy)","level":"UG"},{"name":"MPT (