('annapoorna-medical-college-hospital-salem-ahs','annapoorna-medical-college-hospital-salem-ahs','Annapoorna Medical College & Hospital','AMCH Salem','allied-health-science','Private Medical College & Multi-Specialty Hospital','Private (VMRF Trust — Vinayaka Missions Research Foundation)','2011','Kombadipatti','Salem','Sankari Main Road (NH-47, NH-544), Veerapandi Union, Kombadipatti, Salem - 636308, Tamil Nadu, India (16 km from Salem city)','https://www.google.co.in/maps/place/Annapoorana+Medical+College+and+Hospitals/@11.5741678,78.033913,1477m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m5!3m4!1s0x0:0x210caf4d85b519a7!8m2!3d11.5773263!4d78.0373748','http://amchs.edu.in/','0427-2203000','info@amch.in','https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Annapoorana-Medical-College-Hospital-Salem-214x300.webp','Annapoorna Medical College & Hospital | Salem - CollegeShine','Annapoorna Medical College & Hospital is a private (vmrf trust — vinayaka missions research foundation) allied health science college in Kombadipatti.',NULL, '{"id":"annapoorna-medical-college-hospital-salem-ahs","seo":{"metaTitle":"Annapoorna Medical College & Hospital | Salem - CollegeShine","metaDescription":"Annapoorna Medical College & Hospital is a private (vmrf trust — vinayaka missions research foundation) allied health science college in Kombadipatti.","metaKeywords":["Annapoorna Medical College & Hospital","AMCH Salem","Annapoorna Medical College & Hospital admission 2026","Annapoorna Medical College & Hospital fees","Annapoorna Medical College & Hospital courses","Allied Health Science colleges in Salem","Kombadipatti","Salem","Allied Health Science","Private (VMRF Trust — Vinayaka Missions Research Foundation)","Private Medical College & Multi-Specialty Hospital","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","Chennai (Official)","Approved by National Medical Commission (NMC) for 150 MBBS Seats (Official — MCI/NMC Notification","16-05-2019)","Permission to Conduct Postgraduate Courses in 5 Specialties — MD (Official — NMC MARB","18-08-2022)","Recognized by Ministry of Health & Family Welfare","Government of India (Official)","MBBS (Bachelor of Medicine & Bachelor of Surgery)","MD (Anatomy)","MD (Physiology)","MD (Biochemistry)","MD (Pharmacology)"],"canonicalUrl":null,"robots":"index, follow","h1":"Annapoorna Medical College & Hospital","openGraph":{"title":"Annapoorna Medical College & Hospital | Salem - CollegeShine","description":"Annapoorna Medical College & Hospital is a private (vmrf trust — vinayaka missions research foundation) allied health science college in Kombadipatti.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Annapoorana-Medical-College-Hospital-Salem-214x300.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Annapoorna Medical College & Hospital | Salem - CollegeShine","description":"Annapoorna Medical College & Hospital is a private (vmrf trust — vinayaka missions research foundation) allied health science college in Kombadipatti.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Annapoorana-Medical-College-Hospital-Salem-214x300.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"Annapoorna Medical College & Hospital","shortName":"AMCH Salem","tagline":"Educate • Empower • Enlighten","category":"allied-health-science","type":"Private Medical College & Multi-Specialty Hospital","ownership":"Private (VMRF Trust — Vinayaka Missions Research Foundation)","established":2011,"location":"Kombadipatti","district":"Salem","address":"Sankari Main Road (NH-47, NH-544), Veerapandi Union, Kombadipatti, Salem - 636308, Tamil Nadu, India (16 km from Salem city)","mapLink":"https://www.google.co.in/maps/place/Annapoorana+Medical+College+and+Hospitals/@11.5741678,78.033913,1477m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m5!3m4!1s0x0:0x210caf4d85b519a7!8m2!3d11.5773263!4d78.0373748","mapQuery":"Annapoorna+Medical+College+Hospital+Salem+NH47","website":"http://amchs.edu.in/","phone":"0427-2203000","email":"info@amch.in","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Annapoorana-Medical-College-Hospital-Salem-214x300.webp","videoUrl":"https://youtu.be/WIXGQ0W6wes?si=bofE3SNeRD_d1p_0&_end=2%3A00","affiliation":"Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University, Chennai; Recognized by National Medical Commission (NMC, formerly MCI); Approved by Ministry of Health & Family Welfare, Government of India","accreditation":["Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University, Chennai (Official)","Approved by National Medical Commission (NMC) for 150 MBBS Seats (Official — MCI/NMC Notification, 16-05-2019)","Permission to Conduct Postgraduate Courses in 5 Specialties — MD (Official — NMC MARB, 18-08-2022)","Recognized by Ministry of Health & Family Welfare, Government of India (Official)","BSL-2 Laboratory Certification (NABL & ICMR) for COVID-19 Testing by RT-PCR (Official)","ICMR-Approved Research Projects (ICMR-STS) (Official)","NABL Certification for Laboratory Services (Official)"],"about":"Annapoorna Medical College & Hospital (AMCH), established in 2011 and managed by VMRF Trust, is a premier private medical college in Tamil Nadu approved by the National Medical Commission (formerly MCI) and affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University, Chennai. Located on a serene 45.4-acre campus in Kombadipatti, 16 km from Salem city on National Highway-47, the college offers NMC-approved undergraduate (MBBS) and postgraduate (MD) medical education with an annual MBBS intake of 150 students. The institution operates an integrated 650-750 bedded multi-specialty teaching hospital serving as a tertiary care facility with 24/7 emergency and trauma care, eye bank, and blood bank facilities. With a daily OPD volume of 700-900 patients, it provides robust clinical training exposure for medical students.","highlights":["Established 2011 — 15+ Years of Medical Education & Patient Care Excellence","NMC-Approved 150 MBBS Seats + 5 MD Specialties (Official Recognition)","650-750 Bedded Multi-Specialty Teaching Hospital — Attached Tertiary Care Facility","24/7 Emergency & Trauma Care with Eye Bank & Blood Bank Facilities (Official)","700-900 Daily Outpatients — High-Volume Clinical Training Exposure","Central Library: 2,417 sqm, 12,000+ Books, 70 Indian & 30 International Journals, E-Resources","Advanced Medical Skills & Simulation Labs with High-Fidelity Mannequins","ICMR-Approved Research Projects — Active Research in Multiple Disciplines","Family Adoption Program — Community Health & Rural Outreach","Mentorship Program — Personalized Guidance for Academic & Professional Growth","Strong Emphasis on Skill Development, Clinical Competence & Real-Time Medical Practice","Pollution-Free, Tobacco-Free, Alcohol-Free Campus — Ideal Learning Environment","100% in-House Hospital Placement (Internships with Stipend ~₹10,000/month)"],"departments":[{"name":"MBBS (Bachelor of Medicine & Bachelor of Surgery)","level":"UG"},{"name":"MD (Anatomy)","level":"PG"},{"name":"MD (Physiology)","level":"PG"},{"name":"MD (Biochemistry)","level":"PG"},{"name":"MD (Pharmacology)","level":"PG"},{"name":"MD (Microbiology)","level":"PG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-hospital","name":"650-750 Bedded Multi-Specialty Hospital (Tertiary Care)"},{"icon":"ti-medall","name":"24/7 Emergency & Trauma Care Department"},{"icon":"ti-eye","name":"Eye Bank & Ophthalmology Department"},{"icon":"ti-blood","name":"Blood Bank & Central Laboratory"},{"icon":"ti-surgery","name":"State-of-the-Art Operation Theatres (General & Specialty)"},{"icon":"ti-icu","name":"Exclusive ICUs & Critical Care Units"},{"icon":"ti-fire","name":"Burn Treatment Unit with Specialized Care"},{"icon":"ti-microscope","name":"Advanced Medical Skills & Simulation Labs"},{"icon":"ti-classroom","name":"Digital Lecture Halls & Demonstration Rooms"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library (2,417 sqm, 12,000+ Books, E-Resources)"},{"icon":"ti-laboratory","name":"12+ Specialized Laboratories with Modern Equipment"},{"icon":"ti-computer","name":"Computer Labs & Digital Learning Centers"},{"icon":"ti-gym","name":"Gymnasium & Sports Facilities"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Separate Boys & Girls Hostels (200+ Capacity)"},{"icon":"ti-restaurant","name":"Cafeteria & Mess Facilities"},{"icon":"ti-auditorium","name":"Auditorium & Seminar Halls for CME & Conferences"},{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Wi-Fi Enabled Campus"}],"placementRate":95,"avgPackage":"₹4.5 LPA","highestPackage":"₹8 LPA","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Check Program Eligibility for NEET-UG (MBBS)","desc":"Pass 10+2 with Physics, Chemistry, Biology/Biotechnology; Minimum 50% marks in PCB; Minimum age 17 years as of December 31 of the admission year. For PG (MD), qualify NEET-PG with 2 years clinical experience post-MBBS."},{"title":"Appear for NEET Exam","desc":"Register & appear for National Eligibility cum Entrance Test (NEET) conducted by National Testing Agency (NTA). Scores valid for MBBS & MD admission."},{"title":"NEET Counselling Registration","desc":"Register with Selection Committee, Directorate of Medical Education (DMER), Tamil Nadu via official portal (tnmedicalselection.net) after NEET score declaration."},{"title":"Attend Counselling Session","desc":"Participate in DMER-conducted counselling for private medical college seats. Counselling conducted for Government Quota, Management Quota, and NRI Quota separately."},{"title":"Document Submission & Enrollment","desc":"Submit required documents (10+2 mark sheet, pass certificate, medical fitness certificate, identity proof, passport-size photos, etc.). Complete online fee payment & hostel allotment. Report to college for final enrollment & orientation."}],"scholarships":["Scholarships for SC/ST/OBC Categories (Through Government of Tamil Nadu)","Merit-Based Fee Concessions (Limited, Case-by-Case)","Research Scholarships for Postgraduate Students","Cadet Training Program Support (Military)"],"events":["Continuous Medical Education (CME) Programs (Regular)","International & National Medical Conferences","Guest Lectures from Eminent Physicians & Researchers","Family Adoption Program — Community Health Outreach","Medical Camps in Rural Areas (PHCs at Magudanchavadi & Gugai, ~10-20 km from campus)","Graduation Ceremonies & Convocation (Annual)","Anti-Drug Awareness Week & Road Safety Awareness Programs","World Breastfeeding Week & Bone & Joint Week Celebrations","General Camps & DBCS (Dermatology, Burn, Chest, Surgery) Camps (Monthly)"],"distanceInfo":{"airport":"100 km (Chennai International Airport, approx 2.5 hours by road)","railway":"13 km (Salem Junction Railway Station, approx 20 minutes)","bustand":"18.5 km (Salem Central Bus Stand, approx 25-30 minutes)","city_center":"16 km from Salem City Center"},"hostelFeatures":["Separate Boys & Girls Hostels on Campus","Co-Educational Hostel Options Available","Mess with Daily Vegetarian & Non-Vegetarian Meals","Laundry & Housekeeping Services","Internet & Recreation Facilities","24-Hour Security & Medical Support (On-Campus Health Center)","Hostel Capacity: 200+ Residents","Hostel Fees: Approx ₹80,000/year (Inclusive of Meals)"],"technicalClubs":["Medical Research Interest Group","Clinical Skills & Simulation Club","Anatomy & Pathology Forum","Pharmacology & Therapeutics Club","Community Medicine & Public Health Club"],"culturalClubs":["Student Cultural & Arts Committee","Sports & Recreation Club","Health & Wellness Forum","Mentorship & Peer Support Group"],"communityService":["Family Adoption Program — Integrated Community Health Services","Free Medical Camps in Rural Villages (Magudanchavadi, Gugai, Surrounding Areas)","Eye Care Screening Programs","Health Awareness & Education Programs","Emergency Medical Care (24/7 — Available to All)","Rural Health Training Centers (RHTC) Operations","Support for Underprivileged Patients"]}')
