te Certification)","PG Diploma in Printing & Packaging Technology","Diploma in Digital Photography","Diploma in Textile Design & Printing"],"canonicalUrl":null,"robots":"index, follow","h1":"SIGA Polytechnic College, Chennai","openGraph":{"title":"SIGA Polytechnic College, Chennai | Chennai - CollegeShine","description":"SIGA Polytechnic College, Chennai is a private (salesian institutions of higher education — ius/sdb) diploma / polytechnic college in Kilpauk, Chennai.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/SIGA-POLYTECHNIC-COLLEGE-collegeshine.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"SIGA Polytechnic College, Chennai | Chennai - CollegeShine","description":"SIGA Polytechnic College, Chennai is a private (salesian institutions of higher education — ius/sdb) diploma / polytechnic college in Kilpauk, Chennai.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/SIGA-POLYTECHNIC-COLLEGE-collegeshine.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"SIGA Polytechnic College, Chennai","shortName":"SIGA Polytechnic College","tagline":"Champion Institute in Printing, Packaging & Visual Communication","category":"diploma","type":"Private Polytechnic College (Salesian/Don Bosco Institution)","ownership":"Private (Salesian Institutions of Higher Education — IUS/SDB)","established":1973,"location":"Kilpauk, Chennai","district":"Chennai","address":"49, Taylors Road, Kilpauk, Chennai, Tamil Nadu 600010","mapLink":"https://maps.google.com/?q=SIGA+Polytechnic+College+Kilpauk+Chennai","mapQuery":"SIGA+Polytechnic+College+Kilpauk+Chennai","website":"https://sigaindia.com/","phone":"+91-44-26411588, +91-44-26424204","email":"mailto:collegeoffice@sigaindia.com","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/SIGA-POLYTECHNIC-COLLEGE-collegeshine.webp","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/F5Tvfsvv_Xg?si=aTOun5mpagXRc0_J&amp;start=44","affiliation":"National Board of Accreditation (NBA), Govt. of India; part of the Salesian Institutions of Higher Education (IUS) South Asia Network, following the pedagogy of Don Bosco","accreditation":["Accredited by National Board of Accreditation (NBA), Govt. of India","Part of Salesian Institutions of Higher Education (IUS) South Asia Network","Formal Govt. Certification Diploma in Printing Technology"],"about":"SIGA Polytechnic College, established in 1973, is a Salesian (Don Bosco) institution located at Taylors Road, Kilpauk, Chennai. The college strives to become a champion institute in Printing, Packaging & Visual Communication, offering formal higher education and skill-based programmes to needy and underprivileged students, aligned with the needs of the printing, packaging, and related industries.\\n\\nSIGA is part of the Salesian Institutions of Higher Education (IUS) South Asia network and is accredited by the National Board of Accreditation (NBA), Government of India. The college offers a Formal Training Diploma in Printing Technology with government certification, alongside several private-certification programmes including a Non-Formal Training SIGA Diploma in Printing & Packaging Technology, Advanced Training in Printing Technology, a PG Diploma in Printing & Packaging Technology, a Diploma in Digital Photography, a Diploma in Textile Design & Printing, and a Certificate in Printing Technology. With 452 students and a faculty of 8 professors (4 holding PhDs, 4 holding Master''s degrees), SIGA follows the charismatic pedagogy of Don Bosco in preparing students for careers in the printing and packaging industry.","highlights":["Established 1973 — 50+ Years in Printing & Packaging Education","Accredited by National Board of Accreditation (NBA), Govt. of India","Part of Salesian Institutions of Higher Education (IUS) South Asia Network","Government-Certified Formal Diploma in Printing Technology","7 Diverse Programmes — from Diploma to PG Diploma & Certificate Courses","Follows the Charismatic Pedagogy of Don Bosco","Focus on Skill-Based Training for Needy & Underprivileged Students","On-Campus College Hostels Available"],"departments":[{"name":"Formal Training Diploma in Printing Technology (Govt. Certification)","level":"UG"},{"name":"SIGA Diploma in Printing & Packaging Technology (Non-Formal, Private Certification)","level":"UG"},{"name":"Advanced Training in Printing Technology (Private Certification)","level":"UG"},{"name":"PG Diploma in Printing & Packaging Technology","level":"PG"},{"name":"Diploma in Digital Photography","level":"Diploma"},{"name":"Diploma in Textile Design & Printing","level":"Diploma"},{"name":"Certificate in Printing Technology","level":"UG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Network"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Printing & Design Resource Library"},{"icon":"ti-flask","name":"Printing & Packaging Technology Labs"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"College Hostels"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport Facility"},{"icon":"ti-cpu","name":"Digital Photography Studio"},{"icon":"ti-crown","name":"Placement Support"},{"icon":"ti-heart","name":"Textile Design & Printing Workshop"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports & Recreation"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Seminar Halls"},{"icon":"ti-medall","name":"Skill-Based Training Programmes"},{"icon":"ti-shield","name":"NBA-Accredited Facilities"}],"placementRate":75,"avgPackage":"₹2.2 LPA","highestPackage":"₹4 LPA","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Meet Eligibility Criteria","desc":"Eligibility varies by course; formal diploma programmes typically require 10th pass, while advanced/PG diploma courses may require a prior diploma or degree."},{"title":"Apply to the College","desc":"Submit an application for the desired programme through the official SIGA admissions office."},{"title":"Document Verification","desc":"Submit academic and identity documents for verification."},{"title":"Merit-Based Admission","desc":"Seats are allotted based on merit and eligibility as per college norms, with a focus on needy and underprivileged students."},{"title":"Fee Payment & Enrollment","desc":"Complete fee payment and reporting formalities to confirm admission."}],"scholarships":["Support for Needy & Underprivileged Students (per College Mission Statement)"],"events":["Season of Creation Programme (Salesian Network-Wide)","IUS/ISHE Network Events","Campus Skill Workshops"],"distanceInfo":{"airport":"12 km (Chennai International Airport)","railway":"4 km (Chennai Central)","bustand":"3 km","metro":"1.5 km (Kilpauk Metro)","hospital":"2 km"},"hostelFeatures":["College Hostels Available (per IUS Network)"],"technicalClubs":["Printing Technology Skill Club","Digital Photography Club"],"culturalClubs":["Visual Communication & Design Club"],"communityService":["Support Programmes for Underprivileged Students","Salesian Community Outreach (Don Bosco Mission)"]}'),
('meenakshi-polytechnic-college-dharmapuri','meenakshi-polytechnic-college-dharmapuri','Meenakshi Polytechnic College, Dharmapuri','Meenakshi Polytechnic College','polytechnic','Private Polytechnic College','Private','2010','Regadahalli, Dharmapuri','Dharmapuri','S.F.No. 44/2, Regadahalli (PO), Bommidi (Via), Pappireddipatti (Tk), Dharmapuri, Tamil Nadu 635301','https://maps.google.com/?q=Meenakshi+Polytechnic+College+Regadahalli+Dharmapuri','https://www.meenakshiinstitution.com','04346-269255','mailto:mpcprincipal@gmail.com','https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/MEENAKSHI-POLYTECHNIC-COLLEGE-collegeshine.webp','Meenakshi Polytechnic College, Dharmapuri - CollegeShine','Meenakshi Polytechnic College, Dharmapuri is a private diploma / polytechnic college in Regadahalli, Dharmapuri established in 2010. Empowering Students.',NULL, '{"id":"meenakshi-polytechnic-college-dharmapuri","seo":{"metaTitle":"Meenakshi Polytechnic College, Dharmapuri - CollegeShine","metaDescription":"Meenakshi Polytechnic College, Dharmapuri is a private diploma / polytechnic college in Regadahalli, Dharmapuri established in 2010. Empowering Students.","metaKeywords":["Meenakshi Polytechnic College","Dharmapuri","Meenakshi Polytechnic College","Meenakshi Polytechnic College","Dharmapuri admission 2026","Meenakshi Polytechnic College","Dharmapuri fees","Meenakshi Polytechnic College","Dharmapuri courses","Diploma / Polytechnic colleges in Dharmapuri","Regadahalli","Dharmapuri","Dharmapuri","Diploma / Polytechnic","Private","Private Polytechnic College","AICTE Approved","Affiliated to Directorate of Technical Education","Tamil Nadu","Private Unaided Polytechnic Institution","Diploma in Civil Engineering","Diploma in Electrical and Electronics Engineering","Diploma in Electronics and Communication Engineering","Diploma in Mechanical Engineering","Diploma in Mechanical Engineering (Tool & Die)","Diploma in Agricultural Engineering"],"canonicalUrl":null,"robots":"index, follow","h1":"