('college-of-fisheries-engineering-nagapattinam','college-of-fisheries-engineering-nagapattinam','College of Fisheries Engineering, Nagapattinam','College of Fisheries Engineering','fishery','Government Fisheries Engineering College','Government','2015','Nagapattinam','Nagapattinam','Vettar River View Campus, Panangudi, Nagapattinam, Tamil Nadu 611002','https://maps.google.com/?q=College+of+Fisheries+Engineering+Nagapattinam','https://www.tnjfu.ac.in/cofenag/','04365-256501','mailto:deancofe@tnfu.ac.in','https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/fisheries-college-and-research-institute-thoothukudi.webp','College of Fisheries Engineering, Nagapattinam - CollegeShine','College of Fisheries Engineering, Nagapattinam is a government fishery science college in Nagapattinam established in 2015. Engineering Solutions for.',NULL, '{"id":"college-of-fisheries-engineering-nagapattinam","seo":{"metaTitle":"College of Fisheries Engineering, Nagapattinam - CollegeShine","metaDescription":"College of Fisheries Engineering, Nagapattinam is a government fishery science college in Nagapattinam established in 2015. Engineering Solutions for.","metaKeywords":["College of Fisheries Engineering","Nagapattinam","College of Fisheries Engineering","College of Fisheries Engineering","Nagapattinam admission 2026","College of Fisheries Engineering","Nagapattinam fees","College of Fisheries Engineering","Nagapattinam courses","Fishery Science colleges in Nagapattinam","Nagapattinam","Fishery Science","Government","Government Fisheries Engineering College","AICTE Approved","Constituent College of Tamil Nadu Dr.J.Jayalalithaa Fisheries University","Government of Tamil Nadu Institution","ISO 9001:2015 Certified","B.Tech. Fisheries Engineering","B.Tech. Energy and Environmental Engineering","M.Tech. Fisheries Engineering - Aquacultural Engineering","M.Tech. Fisheries Engineering - Fish Process Engineering"],"canonicalUrl":null,"robots":"index, follow","h1":"College of Fisheries Engineering, Nagapattinam","openGraph":{"title":"College of Fisheries Engineering, Nagapattinam - CollegeShine","description":"College of Fisheries Engineering, Nagapattinam is a government fishery science college in Nagapattinam established in 2015. Engineering Solutions for.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/fisheries-college-and-research-institute-thoothukudi.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"College of Fisheries Engineering, Nagapattinam - CollegeShine","description":"College of Fisheries Engineering, Nagapattinam is a government fishery science college in Nagapattinam established in 2015. Engineering Solutions for.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/fisheries-college-and-research-institute-thoothukudi.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"College of Fisheries Engineering, Nagapattinam","shortName":"College of Fisheries Engineering","tagline":"Engineering Solutions for Sustainable Fisheries and Aquaculture","category":"fishery","type":"Government Fisheries Engineering College","ownership":"Government","established":2015,"location":"Nagapattinam","district":"Nagapattinam","address":"Vettar River View Campus, Panangudi, Nagapattinam, Tamil Nadu 611002","mapLink":"https://maps.google.com/?q=College+of+Fisheries+Engineering+Nagapattinam","mapQuery":"College+of+Fisheries+Engineering+Nagapattinam","website":"https://www.tnjfu.ac.in/cofenag/","phone":"04365-256501","email":"mailto:deancofe@tnfu.ac.in","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/fisheries-college-and-research-institute-thoothukudi.webp","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Br3KFQenJic?si=HCPGottfpXpt2MHA","affiliation":"Tamil Nadu Dr.J.Jayalalithaa Fisheries University (TNJFU)","accreditation":["AICTE Approved","Constituent College of Tamil Nadu Dr.J.Jayalalithaa Fisheries University","Government of Tamil Nadu Institution","ISO 9001:2015 Certified"],"about":"College of Fisheries Engineering (CoFE), Nagapattinam is a constituent college of Tamil Nadu Dr.J.Jayalalithaa Fisheries University. The college was established in 2015 as the first institution of its kind in the country dedicated specifically to developing engineering personnel for the fisheries sector. It evolved from the Institute of Fisheries Technology established by the Government of Tamil Nadu.\\n\\nThe college offers B.Tech. Fisheries Engineering and B.Tech. Energy and Environmental Engineering programmes, while M.Tech. Fisheries Engineering specialisations in Aquacultural Engineering and Fish Process Engineering are offered for postgraduate study. The curriculum combines engineering fundamentals with fisheries science, aquaculture engineering, fish processing, fishing technology, marine engineering, environmental engineering and fisheries management.\\n\\nThe institution supports teaching, research and extension through specialised departments including Fisheries Engineering, Fish Process Engineering, Fisheries Nautical and Marine Engineering and Basic Engineering. Facilities include advanced fish-processing infrastructure, cold-storage facilities, aquaculture research equipment, water-quality and disease-diagnosis laboratories, ornamental fish display units and engineering laboratories.","highlights":["Established in 2015","First Fisheries Engineering College of Its Kind in India","Constituent College of TNJFU","Government of Tamil Nadu Institution","AICTE Recognized Since 2019","ISO 9001:2015 Certified","B.Tech. Fisheries Engineering","B.Tech. Energy & Environmental Engineering","M.Tech. Fisheries Engineering","Aquacultural Engineering Specialisation","Fish Process Engineering Specialisation","Advanced Fish Processing Facility","Cold Storage Facilities","Marine Aqua Workshop","Aquaculture Research Facilities","Water Quality Laboratory","Disease Diagnosis Laboratory","Ornamental Fi