/ipgsomr/","phone":"044-27470696","email":"mailto:deanipgs@tnfu.ac.in","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/fisheries-college-and-research-institute-thoothukudi.webp","videoUrl":"","affiliation":"Tamil Nadu Dr. J. Jayalalithaa Fisheries University (TNJFU)","accreditation":["Constituent College of Tamil Nadu Dr. J. Jayalalithaa Fisheries University","Government of Tamil Nadu Institution","ICAR Common Syllabus Based Programmes","TNJFU Recognized Post Graduate Institute"],"about":"The Institute of Fisheries Post Graduate Studies (IFPGS) is a constituent college of Tamil Nadu Dr. J. Jayalalithaa Fisheries University located at Vaniyanchavadi on OMR, Chennai. The institute was established in 2017 to meet the growing need for postgraduate and research manpower in fisheries science.\\n\\nIFPGS offers postgraduate programmes in advanced and applied disciplines of fisheries science and Ph.D. programmes in specialized research areas. Its academic and research activities cover fisheries biotechnology, fish genetics and breeding, fish nutrition and feed technology, fish pharmacology and toxicology and basic sciences including microbiology and biochemistry.\\n\\nThe institute has a Brackishwater Fish Farm and specialized laboratories including biotechnology, biochemistry, fish genetics, fish nutrition, fish pharmacology and toxicology, cell culture, tissue culture, microbiology, bioinformatics and wet laboratories. It undertakes basic and applied research and provides consultancy and extension support to fisheries industries, fish farmers and entrepreneurs.","highlights":["Established in 2017","Constituent College of TNJFU","Government Fisheries Post Graduate Institute","Located on OMR, Vaniyanchavadi","M.F.Sc. Programmes in Specialized Fisheries Disciplines","Ph.D. Programmes","Fish Biotechnology","Fish Genetics & Breeding","Fish Nutrition & Feed Technology","Fish Pharmacology & Toxicology","Life Sciences","Brackishwater Fish Farm","Biotechnology Laborat