a specialized business school of Tamil Nadu Dr. J. Jayalalithaa Fisheries University located at the DIVA Campus on East Coast Road, Muttukadu, Chennai. The school was established to develop management and entrepreneurship skills specifically for fisheries, aquaculture and allied business enterprises.\\n\\nThe Business School was established by TNJFU during the academic year 2018-2019. It launched the MBA in Fisheries Enterprises Management in 2018-19 and the BBA in Fisheries Enterprises Management in 2019-20. The programmes combine modern management education with fisheries and aquaculture knowledge, emphasizing entrepreneurship, marketing, finance, business strategy, value chains and industry interaction.\\n\\nThe school provides smart classrooms, a specialized business library, digital learning resources, group discussion rooms, a mini seminar hall with modern audio-visual systems and an auditorium. The curriculum includes experiential learning, internships, industrial attachments, business projects, rural aquaculture work experience and educational tours.","highlights":["Established in 2018-2019","First Specialized Fisheries Business School of Its Kind in India","Constituent Unit of TNJFU","AICTE Accredited in 2024","Located at Muttukadu, ECR, Chennai","BBA in Fisheries Enterprises Management","MBA in Fisheries Enterprises Management","4-Year Full-Time BBA","2-Year Full-Time MBA","Fisheries & Aquaculture Business Focus","Entrepreneurship-Oriented Curriculum","Industry Interface & Interaction","Smart Classrooms","Business Library","Digital Resources","Group Discussion Room","Modern AV Seminar Hall","Auditorium","Internship & Industrial Attachment","Rural Aquaculture Work Experience","Fisheries Business Project"],"departments":[{"name":"BBA - Fisheries Enterprises Management","level":"UG"},{"name":"MBA - Fisheries Enterprises Management","level":"PG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Digital Connectivity"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Business Library"},{"ico