ment Institution","B.Voc. - Industrial Fishing Technology"],"canonicalUrl":null,"robots":"index, follow","h1":"Paraprofessional Institute of Fishing Technology, Ramanathapuram","openGraph":{"title":"Paraprofessional Institute of Fishing Technology - CollegeShine","description":"Paraprofessional Institute of Fishing Technology, Ramanathapuram is a government fishery science college in Ariyaman Beach, Ramanathapuram established in.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/fisheries-college-and-research-institute-thoothukudi.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Paraprofessional Institute of Fishing Technology - CollegeShine","description":"Paraprofessional Institute of Fishing Technology, Ramanathapuram is a government fishery science college in Ariyaman Beach, Ramanathapuram established in.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/fisheries-college-and-research-institute-thoothukudi.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"Paraprofessional Institute of Fishing Technology, Ramanathapuram","shortName":"PPIIFT Ramanathapuram","tagline":"Developing Skilled Fishing Technology Professionals Through Practical Maritime Training","category":"fishery","type":"Government Fisheries Vocational Institute","ownership":"Government","established":2019,"location":"Ariyaman Beach, Ramanathapuram","district":"Ramanathapuram","address":"Ariyaman Beach, Ramanathapuram District, Tamil Nadu 623512","mapLink":"https://maps.google.com/?q=Paraprofessional+Institute+of+Fishing+Technology+Ariyaman+Ramanathapuram","mapQuery":"Paraprofessional+Institute+of+Fishing+Technology+Ariyaman+Ramanathapuram","website":"https://www.tnjfu.ac.in/paraprofessional/pift/","phone":"8438823208","email":"mailto:principalpift@tnfu.ac.in","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/fisheries-college-and-research-institute-thoothukudi.webp","videoUrl":"","affiliation":"Tamil Nadu Dr. J. Jayalalithaa Fisheries University (TNJFU)","accreditation":["Constituent Institute of Tamil Nadu Dr. J. Jayalalithaa Fisheries University","UGC Recognized B.Voc. Programme","Directorate General of Shipping Recognized Programme","Government of Tamil Nadu Fisheries Skill Development Institution","NADP Supported Fisheries Training Institute"],"about":"The Paraprofessional Institute of Fishing Technology (PPIIFT) is a Government fisheries vocational institute functioning under Tamil Nadu Dr. J. Jayalalithaa Fisheries University. The institute was established in 2019 with financial assistance under the National Agriculture Development Programme (NADP), Government of India, through the establishment of a fisheries training institute at Mandapam.\\n\\nThe institute offers the three-year B.Voc. in Industrial Fishing Technology programme. The curriculum combines classroom instruction with intensive practical training in fishing technology, nautical science, marine engineering, marine electronics, communication, fishing-gear technology, fishing-craft technology and marine engine operations. The first two years are primarily academic and practical coursework, while the third year includes industry internship.\\n\\nThe institute has five major laboratories: Fishing Gear Technology Laboratory, Fishing Craft Technology Laboratory, Nautical and Marine Communication Laboratory, Marine Engineering Laboratory and Basic Science Laboratory. Additional facilities include a Marine Engine Workshop, Navigational Chart Reading Hall, Smart Classroom, Library, Examination Hall, Conference Hall and Educational Technology cum Placement Cell.\\n\\nThe institute also operates practical training through the 22.7-metre MFV KAYAL research-cum-training vessel for deep-sea longlining, gill-netting, seamanship, navigation and marine communication training.","highlights":["Established in 2019","Government Fisheries Vocational Inst