ity (Deemed to be University)","UGC Recognized Deemed University","NAAC A++ Institutional Quality Environment","Law Programmes Subject to Applicable BCI Recognition / Approval"],"about":"Rathinam Global University''s School of Law is a newly established law school at Rathinam Techzone Campus, Eachanari, Coimbatore. Rathinam Global University entered its new deemed-university phase in 2026, and the School of Law is being developed as a future-ready legal education platform combining law with business, technology, policy and professional practice.\\n\\nThe school currently promotes three principal programmes: the three-year LL.B., five-year B.A. LL.B. (Hons.) and five-year B.B.A. LL.B. (Hons.). The academic positioning emphasizes litigation, judiciary, corporate law, compliance, public policy, startup and innovation law.\\n\\nRGU Law''s learning model combines classroom teaching with moot courts, legal drafting, research projects, case-study discussions, mock trials, court observation, client counselling, internships and legal-awareness programmes. Emerging areas such as cyber law, AI and data governance, technology law, compliance and startup law are also highlighted.\\n\\nThe School of Law is part of the larger Rathinam Global University ecosystem, which emphasizes industry integration, international partnerships, entrepreneurship, research and career readiness.","highlights":["Newly Established School of Law","Part of Rathinam Global University","Coimbatore-Based Deemed University","Admissions Open for 2026","3-Year LL.B.","5-Year B.A. LL.B. (Hons.)","5-Year B.B.A. LL.B. (Hons.)","Practice-Oriented Legal Education","Moot Court Simulation","Legal Drafting & Research","Mock Trials","Courtroom Observation","Client Counselling Exercises","Professional Internships","Legal Awareness Programmes","Corporate Law Orientation","Cyber Law & Technology Law","AI & Data Governance","Compliance & Startup Law","Career-Focused Legal Education"],"departments":[{"name":"LL.B. – 3 Year