('government-college-of-architecture-and-sculpture-mamallapuram','government-college-of-architecture-and-sculpture-mamallapuram','Government College of Architecture and Sculpture, Mamallapuram','GCAS Mamallapuram','fine-arts','Government College','Government','1957','Mamallapuram, Chengalpattu, Tamil Nadu','Chengalpattu','Government College of Architecture and Sculpture, Mamallapuram, Tamil Nadu 603104','https://maps.google.com/?q=Government+College+of+Architecture+and+Sculpture+Mamallapuram','https://artandculture.tn.gov.in/government-college-architecture-and-sculpture','044-27442261','mailto:govtcas@gmail.com','https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/TamilNadu-govt-college-collegshine_7_11zon-150x150.webp','Government College of Architecture and Sculpture - CollegeShine','Government College of Architecture and Sculpture, Mamallapuram is a government fine arts & performing arts college in Mamallapuram, Chengalpattu, Tamil Nadu.',NULL, '{"id":"government-college-of-architecture-and-sculpture-mamallapuram","seo":{"metaTitle":"Government College of Architecture and Sculpture - CollegeShine","metaDescription":"Government College of Architecture and Sculpture, Mamallapuram is a government fine arts & performing arts college in Mamallapuram, Chengalpattu, Tamil Nadu.","metaKeywords":["Government College of Architecture and Sculpture","Mamallapuram","GCAS Mamallapuram","Government College of Architecture and Sculpture","Mamallapuram admission 2026","Government College of Architecture and Sculpture","Mamallapuram fees","Government College of Architecture and Sculpture","Mamallapuram courses","Fine Arts & Performing Arts colleges in Chengalpattu","Mamallapuram","Chengalpattu","Tamil Nadu","Chengalpattu","Fine Arts & Performing Arts","Government","Government College","Government of Tamil Nadu Institution (Official)","Affiliated to Tamil Nadu Dr. J. Jayalalithaa Music and Fine Arts University (Official)","Tamil Nadu Department of Art and Culture Institution (Official)","Government-recognised Higher Education Institution (Official)","B.Tech Traditional Architecture","B.F.A Traditional Sculpture - Stone Sculpture","B.F.A Traditional Sculpture - Sudhai Sculpture","B.F.A Traditional Sculpture - Wood Sculpture","B.F.A Traditional Sculpture - Metal Sculpture"],"canonicalUrl":null,"robots":"index, follow","h1":"Government College of Architecture and Sculpture, Mamallapuram","openGraph":{"title":"Government College of Architecture and Sculpture - CollegeShine","description":"Government College of Architecture and Sculpture, Mamallapuram is a government fine arts & performing arts college in Mamallapuram, Chengalpattu, Tamil Nadu.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/TamilNadu-govt-college-collegshine_7_11zon-150x150.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Government College of Architecture and Sculpture - CollegeShine","description":"Government College of Architecture and Sculpture, Mamallapuram is a government fine arts & performing arts college in Mamallapuram, Chengalpattu, Tamil Nadu.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/TamilNadu-govt-college-collegshine_7_11zon-150x150.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"Government College of Architecture and Sculpture, Mamallapuram","shortName":"GCAS Mamallapuram","tagline":"Preserving Traditional Indian Architecture, Sculpture and Painting","category":"fine-arts","type":"Government College","ownership":"Government","established":1957,"location":"Mamallapuram, Chengalpattu, Tamil Nadu","district":"Chengalpattu","address":"Government College of Architecture and Sculpture, Mamallapuram, Tamil Nadu 603104","mapLink":"https://maps.google.com/?q=Government+College+of+Architecture+and+Sculpture+Mamallapuram","mapQuery":"Government+College+of+Architecture+and+Sculpture+Mamallapuram","website":"https://artandculture.tn.gov.in/government-college-architecture-and-sculpture","phone":"044-27442261","email":"mailto:govtcas@gmail.com","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/TamilNadu-govt-college-collegshine_7_11zon-150x150.webp","videoUrl":"https://artandculture.tn.gov.in/gallery-photos/149","affiliation":"Affiliated to Tamil Nadu Dr. J. Jayalalithaa Music and Fine Arts University, Chennai","accreditation":["Government of Tamil Nadu Institution (Official)","Affiliated to Tamil Nadu Dr. J. Jayalalithaa Music and Fine Arts University (Official)","Tamil Nadu Department of Art and Culture Institution (Official)","Government-recognised Higher Education Institution (Official)"],"about":"Government College of Architecture and Sculpture is a specialised government institution located at Mamallapuram in Chengalpattu District, Tamil Nadu. The institution was started in 1957 as the Sculpture Training Centre under the Department of Industries and Commerce with the objective of reviving and extending the traditional heritage of Indian sculpture and architecture. It later developed through certificate and diploma-level training and subsequently introduced degree programmes in traditional architecture, sculpture and painting. The institution is affiliated to the Tamil Nadu Dr. J. Jayalalithaa Music and Fine Arts University, Chennai. (Official)\\n\\nThe college currently offers four-year undergraduate programmes in B.Tech Traditional Architecture, B.F.A Traditional Sculpture and B.F.A Traditional Drawing and Painting. The official Department of Art and Culture page records 10 seats for Traditional Architecture, 40 seats for Traditional Sculpture and 10 seats for Traditional Drawing and Painting, giving a total sanctioned intake of 60 students. The institution also maintains an art museum showcasing student artworks, provides free art materials worth ₹2,000 per student per year under a government scheme, and organises educational study tours to historical and artistic sites. (Official)","highlights":["Established in 1957 (Official)","Government institution under Tamil Nadu Department of Art and Culture (Official)","Located at Mamallapuram, a UNESCO World Heritage cultural region (Official/Location)","Affiliated to Tamil Nadu Dr. J. Jayalalithaa Music and Fine Arts University (Official)","B.Tech Traditional Architecture programme (Official)","B.F.A Traditional Sculpture programme with 40 seats (Official)","B.F.A Traditional Drawing and Painting programme with 10 seats (Official)","Total undergraduate intake of 60 seats (Official)","Dedicated art museum displaying student artworks (Official)","Mega sculptural studio and practical training environment (Official/Institutional information)","Government-supported educational study tours (Official)","Free art materials worth ₹2,000 per student annually under government scheme (Official)"],"departments":[{"name":"B.Tech Traditional Architecture","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.F.A Traditional Sculpture - Stone Sculpture","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.F.A Traditional Sculpture - Sudhai Sculpture","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.F.A Traditional Sculpture - Wood Sculpture","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.F.A Traditional Sculpture - Metal Sculpture","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.F.A Traditional Drawing and Painting","level":"UG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Library"},{"icon":"ti-flask","name":"Departmental Practical Laboratories"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Boys Hostel"},{"icon":"ti-brush","name":"Sculpture Training Facilities"},{"icon":"ti-paint-bucket","name":"Traditional Painting Facilities"},{"icon":"ti-ruler-alt-2","name":"Traditional Architecture Training"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Computer / IT Infrastructure"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports Facilities"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Auditorium / Event Facilities"},{"icon":"ti-image","name":"Art Museum"},{"icon":"ti-vector","name":"Mega Sculptural Studio"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Educational Study Tour Support"}],"placementRate":"60-70% 