hops (Approx.)","Traditional Painting Workshops (Approx.)","Architecture and Heritage Study Activities (Approx.)","Educational Study Tours to Historical Sites (Official)","Art Exhibitions and Student Artwork Displays (Approx.)","Cultural and Fine Arts Activities (Approx.)"],"distanceInfo":{"airport":"55 km from Chennai International Airport (Approx.; Government of India tourism source)","railway":"30 km from Chengalpattu railway station (Approx.; Government of India tourism source)","bustand":"2 km from Mamallapuram Bus Stand (Approx.)","metro":"Metro rail is not directly available in Mamallapuram (Approx.)","hospital":"3 km from nearby major healthcare facilities in Mamallapuram (Approx.)"},"hostelFeatures":["On-campus Boys Hostel (Official)","Hostel accommodation for students","Basic residential facilities (Approx.)","Study accommodation (Approx.)","Common student facilities (Approx.)","Government hostel fee structure","Hostel fee listed as ₹4,000 in official college fee details","Campus-based student accommodation"],"technicalClubs":["Traditional Architecture Study Group (Approx.)","Sculpture Practice Club (Approx.)","Traditional Painting Practice Group (Approx.)","Heritage Conservation Study Group (Approx.)","Digital Design and Documentation Group (Approx.)"],"culturalClubs":["Traditional Arts Club (Approx.)","Sculpture Club (Approx.)","Painting Club (Approx.)","Cultural Heritage Club (Approx.)","Photography and Documentation Club (Approx.)"],"communityService":["Government-supported Cultural Heritage Activities (Approx.)","Traditional Art Awareness Activities (Approx.)","Heritage Study Tours (Official)","Public Art and Museum Exposure Activities (Official)","Traditional Art Demonstration Activities (Approx.)","Cultural Awareness Programmes (Approx.)"]}'),
