:"Palme Deor Film & Media College, Tambaram - CollegeShine","description":"Palme Deor Film & Media College, Tambaram is a private fine arts & performing arts college in Tambaram West, Chennai established in 2016. High-End.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Palme-Deor-Film-Media-College-Thanjavur_5_11zon-300x300.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Palme Deor Film & Media College, Tambaram - CollegeShine","description":"Palme Deor Film & Media College, Tambaram is a private fine arts & performing arts college in Tambaram West, Chennai established in 2016. High-End.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Palme-Deor-Film-Media-College-Thanjavur_5_11zon-300x300.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"Palme Deor Film & Media College, Tambaram","shortName":"Palme Deor Media College","tagline":"High-End Professional College for Film & Media Education","category":"fine-arts","type":"Private Affiliated College","ownership":"Private","established":2016,"location":"Tambaram West, Chennai","district":"Chennai","address":"BSS Tower, Bharathi Nagar First Main Road, Tambaram West, Chennai, Tamil Nadu 600063","mapLink":"https://maps.google.com/?q=Palme+Deor+Film+and+Media+College+Tambaram","mapQuery":"Palme+Deor+Film+and+Media+College+Tambaram","website":"https://www.palmedeor.in","phone":"044-2276 2211","email":"mailto:info@palmedeor.in","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Palme-Deor-Film-Media-College-Thanjavur_5_11zon-300x300.webp","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/E19iSfjX0mM?si=E92zLIXo1qL5-q2e","affiliation":"Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. J. Jayalalithaa Music and Fine Arts University, Chennai","accreditation":["Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. J. Jayalalithaa Music and Fine Arts University","ISO 9001:2015 Certified (reported in published institutional material)","Recognized / Affiliated Film & Media Institution"],"about":"Palme Deor Film & Media College is a private film and media education institution located at Bharathi Nagar First Main Road, Tambaram West, Chennai. The institution is listed by the Tamil Nadu Department of Art and Culture among the affiliated self-financing colleges of The Tamil Nadu Dr. J. Jayalalithaa Music and Fine Arts University. The university''s official listing identifies the Chennai institution at the Bharathi Nagar First Main Road address and records its affiliation. The college has also been described in published institutional material as a high-end professional college focused on film, media and visual communication.\\\\n\\\\nThe institution provides undergraduate, diploma and postgraduate-level programmes covering visual communication, cinematography, direction and screenplay writing, advertising and media marketing, photography, editing, VFX, digital film grading, radio/video jockeying, news reading and reporting, and cinema acting. Historical institutional material also highlights practical film projects, industry-oriented training, guest lecturers from the media industry, air-conditioned classrooms and placement assistance. Current education listings report 15 courses at the Tambaram campus, including BFA, BVA, B.Des and diploma/PGD programmes.","highlights":["Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. J. Jayalalithaa Music and Fine Arts University","Located at BSS Tower, Bharathi Nagar, Tambaram West","Dedicated Film & Media Education Institution","BFA Visual Communication Programme","BVA Cinematography Programme","BVA Direction and Screen Play Writing Programme","Industry-Oriented Practical Training","Film & Media Production Exposure","Guest Faculty / Industry Interaction","Air-Conditioned Classrooms","Media & Film Production Facilities","Placement Assistance"],"departments":[{"name":"BFA Visual Communication","level":"UG"},{"name":"BVA Cinematography","level":"UG"},{"name":"