am","Diploma in Bharathanatyam"],"canonicalUrl":null,"robots":"index, follow","h1":"Alagappa College of Performing Arts Academy, Alagappapuram, Karaikudi","openGraph":{"title":"Alagappa College of Performing Arts Academy - CollegeShine","description":"Alagappa College of Performing Arts Academy, Alagappapuram, Karaikudi is a private fine arts & performing arts college in Alagappapuram, Karaikudi.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Alagappa-College-of-Performing-Arts-Academy-Alagappapuram-Karaikudi_4_11zon-3-150x150.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Alagappa College of Performing Arts Academy - CollegeShine","description":"Alagappa College of Performing Arts Academy, Alagappapuram, Karaikudi is a private fine arts & performing arts college in Alagappapuram, Karaikudi.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Alagappa-College-of-Performing-Arts-Academy-Alagappapuram-Karaikudi_4_11zon-3-150x150.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"Alagappa College of Performing Arts Academy, Alagappapuram, Karaikudi","shortName":"Alagappa College of Performing Arts","tagline":"Preserving and Promoting Indian Classical Music and Performing Arts","category":"fine-arts","type":"Private Self-Financing Performing Arts Institution","ownership":"Private","established":2016,"location":"Alagappapuram, Karaikudi","district":"Sivaganga","address":"Alagappapuram, Karaikudi, Sivaganga District, Tamil Nadu 630003","mapLink":"https://maps.google.com/?q=Alagappa+College+of+Performing+Arts+Academy+Karaikudi","mapQuery":"Alagappa+College+of+Performing+Arts+Academy+Karaikudi","website":"https://alagappaarts.com/","phone":"04565-230491","email":"performingarts@alagappa.org","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Alagappa-College-of-Performing-Arts-Academy-Alagappapuram-Karaikudi_4_11